(1966329, 269727, 42826, '<td valign="top">What a natural shot!  Nice capture...she really does appear to be afraid!</td>', 'What a natural shot!  Nice capture...she really does appear to be afraid!', '2005-12-21 00:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966355, 271368, 10261, '<td valign="top">The idea isn''t bad, but the execution leaves something to be desired. It looks like this was thrown together in a couple of minutes. More purposeful lighting would have really helped here. <br/></td>', 'The idea isn''t bad, but the execution leaves something to be desired. It looks like this was thrown together in a couple of minutes. More purposeful lighting would have really helped here. ', '2005-12-21 00:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966357, 269282, 42826, '<td valign="top">love the black and white, how you can only see one eye....nice...</td>', 'love the black and white, how you can only see one eye....nice...', '2005-12-21 00:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966361, 270953, 42826, '<td valign="top">WOW, that''s amazing....you captured this phobia very well!</td>', 'WOW, that''s amazing....you captured this phobia very well!', '2005-12-21 00:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966370, 269282, 18157, '<td valign="top">Wow, the eyes are riveting! Beautiful girl!</td>', 'Wow, the eyes are riveting! Beautiful girl!', '2005-12-21 00:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966372, 271253, 42826, '<td valign="top">i think her eyes should have shown she was afraid to speak...but the phobia is a great one...the b&amp;w is great too!</td>', 'i think her eyes should have shown she was afraid to speak...but the phobia is a great one...the b&w is great too!', '2005-12-21 00:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966376, 269800, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like the grainy feel of the photo, and the selective desat works well to bring out the rose and the coke, but would have preferred if only the rose was coloured. 9</td>', 'I like the grainy feel of the photo, and the selective desat works well to bring out the rose and the coke, but would have preferred if only the rose was coloured. 9', '2005-12-21 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966387, 271240, 10261, '<td valign="top">This image is pretty evenly divided between the sky and the foreground. I think that the composition would have been stronger if there was more emphasis on one or the other. Given the subject the colors are rather bright and cheery, but not enough to make it feel like an intentional contrast. I''d suggest adding some image grain and dropping the saturation a bit or trying to make the contrast between the happy colors and the sad subject feel more intentional.<br/> <br/>The fact that the epitaph is legible on at least the first few tombstones ties the cometary to someplace in the southern U.S. Since the details about this particular cometary aren''t relevant to your message about cemeteries in general, you might want to consider obscuring the locale specific details somehow (a wider angle shot, etc.).<br/> <br/></td>', 'This image is pretty evenly divided between the sky and the foreground. I think that the composition would have been stronger if there was more emphasis on one or the other. Given the subject the colors are rather bright and cheery, but not enough to make it feel like an intentional contrast. I''d suggest adding some image grain and dropping the saturation a bit or trying to make the contrast between the happy colors and the sad subject feel more intentional. The fact that the epitaph is legible on at least the first few tombstones ties the cometary to someplace in the southern U.S. Since the details about this particular cometary aren''t relevant to your message about cemeteries in general, you might want to consider obscuring the locale specific details somehow (a wider angle shot, etc.). ', '2005-12-21 00:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966393, 271253, 22379, '<td valign="top">Cindi - i recognised your gal from the thumb no less!!</td>', 'Cindi - i recognised your gal from the thumb no less!!', '2005-12-21 00:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966396, 271163, 48560, '<td valign="top">great idea, and a pleasant one to look at too. Especially like the reflection on the floor tiles, and the colours. Might be better if focus can be sharper. The over exposed yellow sign in the back looks slightly distracting. 9</td>', 'great idea, and a pleasant one to look at too. Especially like the reflection on the floor tiles, and the colours. Might be better if focus can be sharper. The over exposed yellow sign in the back looks slightly distracting. 9', '2005-12-21 00:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
