(1966420, 271223, 43671, '<td valign="top">love the lighting and the feel of fear really comes out.8</td>', 'love the lighting and the feel of fear really comes out.8', '2005-12-21 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966421, 270473, 45000, '<td valign="top">Marbo...ahhh.  I still love your infrareds.  I actually shot my pun entry with a Nikon CP 950 with a Hoya R72 infrared filter.  It will be in the top ten, make sure you look for it.  You are the only reason I got started in infrared photography...so thanks!  I''m getting a Oly 2020z for christmas..If I can do work half as good as yours I will be satisfied.  You get a 10 from me.  Oh..and I hope this is you, and not some random person, lol.</td>', 'Marbo...ahhh.  I still love your infrareds.  I actually shot my pun entry with a Nikon CP 950 with a Hoya R72 infrared filter.  It will be in the top ten, make sure you look for it.  You are the only reason I got started in infrared photography...so thanks!  I''m getting a Oly 2020z for christmas..If I can do work half as good as yours I will be satisfied.  You get a 10 from me.  Oh..and I hope this is you, and not some random person, lol.', '2005-12-21 00:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966423, 270217, 46045, '<td valign="top">oh my!  i know someone with an extreme fear of clowns. i''m sure she''d nearly pass out if she saw this!    excellent shot. and certainly creepy.</td>', 'oh my!  i know someone with an extreme fear of clowns. i''m sure she''d nearly pass out if she saw this!    excellent shot. and certainly creepy.', '2005-12-21 00:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966424, 271257, 10261, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like the eyes peering out of the larger matreshka (sp?) doll. The upper half in the foreground helps to clarify what the focal point is; without this it would have taken me longer to identify what I was looking at. The overlap between the doll in the foreground and the one in the back feels somewhat claustrophobic. This may or may not be intentional, but moving the foreground doll to the right would reduce the effect. The pure white background seems a little overbearing; I would have preferred a light shade of grey.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like the eyes peering out of the larger matreshka (sp?) doll. The upper half in the foreground helps to clarify what the focal point is; without this it would have taken me longer to identify what I was looking at. The overlap between the doll in the foreground and the one in the back feels somewhat claustrophobic. This may or may not be intentional, but moving the foreground doll to the right would reduce the effect. The pure white background seems a little overbearing; I would have preferred a light shade of grey. ', '2005-12-21 00:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966427, 271092, 46045, '<td valign="top">fantastic. lol</td>', 'fantastic. lol', '2005-12-21 00:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
