(1966476, 271305, 49007, '<td valign="top">I almost feel the fear... Not quite.</td>', 'I almost feel the fear... Not quite.', '2005-12-21 00:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966481, 271161, 48560, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this shot, and the very dirty (but full of attitude) wooden floor and chair. Would prefer not to see the other plastic(?) seats on top of the photo though. 9</td>', 'I like the lighting on this shot, and the very dirty (but full of attitude) wooden floor and chair. Would prefer not to see the other plastic(?) seats on top of the photo though. 9', '2005-12-21 00:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966491, 269079, 10261, '<td valign="top">The message-bearing portion of this image occupies relatively little area in this image. I think that your composition would get more bang for it''s buck if you made the presentation more minimalistic (showing 13 fingers seems excessive). Since the message is less than happy using a darker background would have helped to create the appropriate atmosphere. Showing simply one finger with the blade poised to ram under the fingernail would have been a more concise way to convey the same idea.</td>', 'The message-bearing portion of this image occupies relatively little area in this image. I think that your composition would get more bang for it''s buck if you made the presentation more minimalistic (showing 13 fingers seems excessive). Since the message is less than happy using a darker background would have helped to create the appropriate atmosphere. Showing simply one finger with the blade poised to ram under the fingernail would have been a more concise way to convey the same idea.', '2005-12-21 00:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966498, 271092, 48560, '<td valign="top">Hey this is good! Might look even more convincing if the plastic guy curls up with his face down on the ground (more agony look). Nice. 9</td>', 'Hey this is good! Might look even more convincing if the plastic guy curls up with his face down on the ground (more agony look). Nice. 9', '2005-12-21 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966501, 271362, 10261, '<td valign="top">If wrinkles are the focal point then cropping to include only the woman''s hands or face would have been more effective. As it is her busy shirt, the stitches in her knee, the knife, and the other incidental details cloud your message.</td>', 'If wrinkles are the focal point then cropping to include only the woman''s hands or face would have been more effective. As it is her busy shirt, the stitches in her knee, the knife, and the other incidental details cloud your message.', '2005-12-21 00:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966507, 270695, 46601, '<td valign="top">Great idea .. would have been better perhaps if the apple was in focus and the umbrella was a lighter colour</td>', 'Great idea .. would have been better perhaps if the apple was in focus and the umbrella was a lighter colour', '2005-12-21 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966513, 270502, 48560, '<td valign="top">wow... the empty space and the lonely-looking tree really sets the mood here. I like the way the brances of the tree sort of fades off. 9</td>', 'wow... the empty space and the lonely-looking tree really sets the mood here. I like the way the brances of the tree sort of fades off. 9', '2005-12-21 00:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966521, 271062, 10261, '<td valign="top">The idea is great, but I think that the presentation would have been stronger if you''d have not blown out quite so many of the features.</td>', 'The idea is great, but I think that the presentation would have been stronger if you''d have not blown out quite so many of the features.', '2005-12-21 00:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966526, 271076, 39588, '<td valign="top">Wow! I loveee this picture. One of the few deserving a high score.</td>', 'Wow! I loveee this picture. One of the few deserving a high score.', '2005-12-21 00:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966527, 269427, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the left half of the image, but I don''t see any strong connection to the challenge topic. The image grain is a nice touch.</td>', 'I like the left half of the image, but I don''t see any strong connection to the challenge topic. The image grain is a nice touch.', '2005-12-21 00:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966530, 271253, 39588, '<td valign="top">i love this picture!!!! Well executed and great concept. One of the few deserving a high score.</td>', 'i love this picture!!!! Well executed and great concept. One of the few deserving a high score.', '2005-12-21 01:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966532, 270446, 46336, '<td valign="top">The term is acrophobia.<br/>Still, I like the shot. I was thinking along similar lines but couldn''t find the right composition.</td>', 'The term is acrophobia.Still, I like the shot. I was thinking along similar lines but couldn''t find the right composition.', '2005-12-21 01:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966534, 270999, 10261, '<td valign="top">Your image unambiguously defines the named phobia (unlike a lot of the other entries), but somehow the image doesn''t strike me as noteworthy. There''s nothing wrong with it, it''s just not particularly interesting.</td>', 'Your image unambiguously defines the named phobia (unlike a lot of the other entries), but somehow the image doesn''t strike me as noteworthy. There''s nothing wrong with it, it''s just not particularly interesting.', '2005-12-21 01:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966535, 270953, 24976, '<td valign="top">If this doesnt get top 10 it would really be a shame. very good shot, i dont mind the hand being oof but i think other voters might. otherwise very good job! 9</td>', 'If this doesnt get top 10 it would really be a shame. very good shot, i dont mind the hand being oof but i think other voters might. otherwise very good job! 9', '2005-12-21 01:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966538, 271328, 48560, '<td valign="top">This photo potrays a very soothing feeling. I would prefer to have the left part of the photo cropped off as the white on his(her) body is slightly distracting. A little USM would also greatly enhance the cat''s details. 9</td>', 'This photo potrays a very soothing feeling. I would prefer to have the left part of the photo cropped off as the white on his(her) body is slightly distracting. A little USM would also greatly enhance the cat''s details. 9', '2005-12-21 01:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966539, 271368, 46336, '<td valign="top">Frightening...</td>', 'Frightening...', '2005-12-21 01:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966540, 271092, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like this one conceptually, very much. It''s skilfully lit and composed as well. My only technical nit is that the highlights on the foreground figure are a bit too hot. Given the obvious thought and skill that went into this, I find myself curious why you chose to have the plastic figure OOF and the larger of the wooden ones IN focus.<br/> <br/>For me, the illustrated phobia "belongs" to the plastic figure, who fears the wooden ones, so it seems to me HE should be sharply in focus. I believe it would not only be better conceptually, but compositionally as well; I''d like to see the plane of focus dropping off so the taller woody is shilghtly OOF and the smaller woody  noticeably so.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I like it :-) Feel free to PM me if you''re so inclined, I done voted this one :-)</td>', 'I like this one conceptually, very much. It''s skilfully lit and composed as well. My only technical nit is that the highlights on the foreground figure are a bit too hot. Given the obvious thought and skill that went into this, I find myself curious why you chose to have the plastic figure OOF and the larger of the wooden ones IN focus. For me, the illustrated phobia "belongs" to the plastic figure, who fears the wooden ones, so it seems to me HE should be sharply in focus. I believe it would not only be better conceptually, but compositionally as well; I''d like to see the plane of focus dropping off so the taller woody is shilghtly OOF and the smaller woody  noticeably so. Anyway, I like it :-) Feel free to PM me if you''re so inclined, I done voted this one :-)', '2005-12-21 01:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966542, 270502, 10261, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but somehow the fence seems to detract from the image overall. The dead grass along the fence line does a nice job of grounding the tree.</td>', 'I like the image, but somehow the fence seems to detract from the image overall. The dead grass along the fence line does a nice job of grounding the tree.', '2005-12-21 01:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966544, 271113, 48560, '<td valign="top">the shallow DOF dont seem well suited to my taste. Would have prefer more of the finger (esp the nails) in focus. a creepy photo nonetheless. good work. 8</td>', 'the shallow DOF dont seem well suited to my taste. Would have prefer more of the finger (esp the nails) in focus. a creepy photo nonetheless. good work. 8', '2005-12-21 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966548, 269660, 49007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Not too scary...</td>', 'Beautiful image. Not too scary...', '2005-12-21 01:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966550, 269701, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nicely done; the slight misalignment between the source of the flame and the mouth is somewhat distracting. The photo would be more emotive if the model''s eyes weren''t half closed.<br/></td>', 'Nicely done; the slight misalignment between the source of the flame and the mouth is somewhat distracting. The photo would be more emotive if the model''s eyes weren''t half closed.', '2005-12-21 01:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966557, 269800, 10261, '<td valign="top">The strong shadow behind the bottle and the glare from the flash are distracting. Aside from that I like the image.</td>', 'The strong shadow behind the bottle and the glare from the flash are distracting. Aside from that I like the image.', '2005-12-21 01:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966559, 271233, 35321, '<td valign="top">The ground-level view helps make them look intimidating--nice job!  The composition works well, though I''d like to see more of the legs and less of the sky.</td>', 'The ground-level view helps make them look intimidating--nice job!  The composition works well, though I''d like to see more of the legs and less of the sky.', '2005-12-21 01:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966562, 270357, 49007, '<td valign="top">Is it still a river if it''s solid ice?</td>', 'Is it still a river if it''s solid ice?', '2005-12-21 01:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966567, 270647, 10261, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, but this feels like a snapshot. The fact that the title is such a stretch to make this seem related to the challenge topic doesn''t help.  Including the top edge of his shorts helps to remove the implication that he''s nude.</td>', 'Cute kid, but this feels like a snapshot. The fact that the title is such a stretch to make this seem related to the challenge topic doesn''t help.  Including the top edge of his shorts helps to remove the implication that he''s nude.', '2005-12-21 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966569, 270918, 30861, '<td valign="top">hahaha! I''d like to think the owner of the house had come to terms with this fear... If not, lawd help him! This is very nicely done, technically, given the source illumination and the basic editing restrictions. The composition is taut and vibrant. The busy-ness of it is appealing, for me at least. And it''s nice to glean a chuckle from these entries, so a good score for you :-)</td>', 'hahaha! I''d like to think the owner of the house had come to terms with this fear... If not, lawd help him! This is very nicely done, technically, given the source illumination and the basic editing restrictions. The composition is taut and vibrant. The busy-ness of it is appealing, for me at least. And it''s nice to glean a chuckle from these entries, so a good score for you :-)', '2005-12-21 01:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966573, 270473, 49007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Not phobic, but beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Not phobic, but beautiful.', '2005-12-21 01:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966581, 270933, 10261, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp capture. The strong lines in the background lead my eyes back to the doll. The doll looks a little bit unnaturally devoid of surface detail, but I suppose that this isn''t implausible for a plastic doll; with any other subject this would look over-NeatImaged.</td>', 'Nice, sharp capture. The strong lines in the background lead my eyes back to the doll. The doll looks a little bit unnaturally devoid of surface detail, but I suppose that this isn''t implausible for a plastic doll; with any other subject this would look over-NeatImaged.', '2005-12-21 01:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966587, 271118, 10261, '<td valign="top">The idea is an interesting one, but the execution feels too fake.</td>', 'The idea is an interesting one, but the execution feels too fake.', '2005-12-21 01:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966588, 270877, 46336, '<td valign="top">It''s a bird all right. Nice shot of one too. Personally, i just don''t feel you''re conveying any phobia here. If I''m any judge you feel this chap is majestic (I do too). Still a nice shot though, although I''d prefer it a little sharper - 6.</td>', 'It''s a bird all right. Nice shot of one too. Personally, i just don''t feel you''re conveying any phobia here. If I''m any judge you feel this chap is majestic (I do too). Still a nice shot though, although I''d prefer it a little sharper - 6.', '2005-12-21 01:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966589, 271253, 45000, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Christine...at least I think this is yours:P  The eyes show a lot of emotion here, something that most of the photos lack.  Good luck on the challenge!</td>', 'Nice shot Christine...at least I think this is yours:P  The eyes show a lot of emotion here, something that most of the photos lack.  Good luck on the challenge!', '2005-12-21 01:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966592, 270798, 49007, '<td valign="top">Needs some cropping at the bottom.</td>', 'Needs some cropping at the bottom.', '2005-12-21 01:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966598, 270397, 28742, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fantastic. A 9 from me. 10 if the screamer was also in focus, but that would''ve been quite a feat. Great job though.</td>', 'Absolutely fantastic. A 9 from me. 10 if the screamer was also in focus, but that would''ve been quite a feat. Great job though.', '2005-12-21 01:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1966599, 269456, 10261, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t that the caption from a Far Side cartoon? The rubber ducky in the foreground is a nice touch. The girl''s pose is a little odd, and it''s hard to tell what she''s doing. The background is rather distracting, as are the image grain and soft focus. Bonus points for the Larson reference though.</td>', 'Wasn''t that the caption from a Far Side cartoon? The rubber ducky in the foreground is a nice touch. The girl''s pose is a little odd, and it''s hard to tell what she''s doing. The background is rather distracting, as are the image grain and soft focus. Bonus points for the Larson reference though.', '2005-12-21 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
