(1966603, 271233, 46336, '<td valign="top">Horses, yes? Black ones too. Somehow you''re not managing to convey any phobia. I think this composition would also benefit from a sharper focus. Otherwsie technically sound.</td>', 'Horses, yes? Black ones too. Somehow you''re not managing to convey any phobia. I think this composition would also benefit from a sharper focus. Otherwsie technically sound.', '2005-12-21 01:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
