(1967076, 271343, 42984, '<td valign="top">Now this is really good.  The tree is great, perhaps it doesn''t look that menacing but then I don''t have the phobia:)  The centred composition bugs me a bit but I don''t know that it would work any better another way.  Borders ften loose you points but this one is quite appropriate</td>', 'Now this is really good.  The tree is great, perhaps it doesn''t look that menacing but then I don''t have the phobia:)  The centred composition bugs me a bit but I don''t know that it would work any better another way.  Borders ften loose you points but this one is quite appropriate', '2005-12-21 04:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967077, 269449, 42984, '<td valign="top">Yep, works for me:)</td>', 'Yep, works for me:)', '2005-12-21 04:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967078, 270999, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great shot (8)</td>', 'Great shot (8)', '2005-12-21 04:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967079, 270241, 2022, '<td valign="top">Great shot (8)</td>', 'Great shot (8)', '2005-12-21 04:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967080, 269065, 42984, '<td valign="top">Is it meant to be Gynephobia - fear of women?  Gyno isn''t in the list of phobias but looks like a good name for fear of an internal examination :)</td>', 'Is it meant to be Gynephobia - fear of women?  Gyno isn''t in the list of phobias but looks like a good name for fear of an internal examination :)', '2005-12-21 04:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
