(1967084, 270403, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great studio controlled light and beautiful clarity.  The composition doesn''t do a lot for me though.</td>', 'Great studio controlled light and beautiful clarity.  The composition doesn''t do a lot for me though.', '2005-12-21 04:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967086, 269427, 42984, '<td valign="top">And the phobia is?  I really like the possibilities for this image.  There is so much mystery and interst in it.  The story behind it coupled with the atrocious conditions makes this a very very strong image.  You need to adjust your verticals too.</td>', 'And the phobia is?  I really like the possibilities for this image.  There is so much mystery and interst in it.  The story behind it coupled with the atrocious conditions makes this a very very strong image.  You need to adjust your verticals too.', '2005-12-21 04:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
