(1967089, 270397, 35322, '<td valign="top">this is definetly a winner! 10! excellent!</td>', 'this is definetly a winner! 10! excellent!', '2005-12-21 04:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967097, 269873, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is so clever in concept.  It hits the phobia, it makes an interesting story and there is humour in it.  It could have been worth an 8 vote<br/> <br/>Then why oh why have you not rotated it so your verticals (the pakcs) are vertical.  And what is that blue rubbish all about?  I completely destroys your image in every way.  You can''t see what the guy is actually doing, it obscures every point of interest in the image and it looks messy.  Thats really a shame 4</td>', 'This is so clever in concept.  It hits the phobia, it makes an interesting story and there is humour in it.  It could have been worth an 8 vote Then why oh why have you not rotated it so your verticals (the pakcs) are vertical.  And what is that blue rubbish all about?  I completely destroys your image in every way.  You can''t see what the guy is actually doing, it obscures every point of interest in the image and it looks messy.  Thats really a shame 4', '2005-12-21 04:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967101, 270408, 42984, '<td valign="top">A phobia would be not being able to go out on windy days.  It''s a really goood photograph though.  I just love the tie!</td>', 'A phobia would be not being able to go out on windy days.  It''s a really goood photograph though.  I just love the tie!', '2005-12-21 04:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967103, 270397, 2022, '<td valign="top">Hmm....anthropophobia ? I thought anthropophobia was a fear of people or society...the picture seems to be conveying fear of mice...nice picture with a wrong title to go with it, methinks...</td>', 'Hmm....anthropophobia ? I thought anthropophobia was a fear of people or society...the picture seems to be conveying fear of mice...nice picture with a wrong title to go with it, methinks...', '2005-12-21 04:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1967105, 269723, 42984, '<td valign="top">This really looks an awful mess.  The blur effect you''ve gone for has really been spoilt by the B&amp;W.  Having blended all the points of interest and then robbed them of their distinguishing colour means its very hard to make out the story your image is telling.</td>', 'This really looks an awful mess.  The blur effect you''ve gone for has really been spoilt by the B&W.  Having blended all the points of interest and then robbed them of their distinguishing colour means its very hard to make out the story your image is telling.', '2005-12-21 04:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
