(1968142, 270461, 46634, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to seen from his snout to his eyes in focus, then fade back, but personal pref.  Good capture though</td>', 'Would have liked to seen from his snout to his eyes in focus, then fade back, but personal pref.  Good capture though', '2005-12-21 13:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968145, 270600, 46634, '<td valign="top">Love his expression, so evil looking</td>', 'Love his expression, so evil looking', '2005-12-21 13:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968152, 270397, 6519, '<td valign="top">I think your title should have been Musophobia, Murophobia or Suriphobia because Anthropophobia means fear of people or society.<br/> <br/>I also would have made sure that the glass is spotless, your many spots are quite distracting.<br/>Having said all that, now I move onto the positive. I LOVE IT !!! It was a clever idea, and truly shows the fear not just the object of the fear. Very nice !!!!! 8</td>', 'I think your title should have been Musophobia, Murophobia or Suriphobia because Anthropophobia means fear of people or society. I also would have made sure that the glass is spotless, your many spots are quite distracting.Having said all that, now I move onto the positive. I LOVE IT !!! It was a clever idea, and truly shows the fear not just the object of the fear. Very nice !!!!! 8', '2005-12-21 13:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968158, 270501, 46634, '<td valign="top">Hope she didnt fall in, looks cold in there</td>', 'Hope she didnt fall in, looks cold in there', '2005-12-21 13:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968159, 271161, 6519, '<td valign="top">There aren''t even any eyes in the room, let alone showing fear.</td>', 'There aren''t even any eyes in the room, let alone showing fear.', '2005-12-21 13:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968166, 269701, 6519, '<td valign="top">If he has a fear of it, why is he doing it?</td>', 'If he has a fear of it, why is he doing it?', '2005-12-21 13:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968174, 271118, 6519, '<td valign="top">Thank you for actually making an effort to show the fear.</td>', 'Thank you for actually making an effort to show the fear.', '2005-12-21 13:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968183, 270202, 6519, '<td valign="top">Well done, he looks pretty convincing. The stark, contrasty b&amp;w is the perfect choice for this.</td>', 'Well done, he looks pretty convincing. The stark, contrasty b&w is the perfect choice for this.', '2005-12-21 13:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968189, 270883, 6519, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, but doesn''t show fear.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, but doesn''t show fear.', '2005-12-21 13:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968192, 271311, 6519, '<td valign="top">He is being cute, funny, goofy, silly whatever.... I don''t see any fear, sorry.</td>', 'He is being cute, funny, goofy, silly whatever.... I don''t see any fear, sorry.', '2005-12-21 13:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968202, 270675, 6519, '<td valign="top">Thank you for making a real effort to show FEAR.</td>', 'Thank you for making a real effort to show FEAR.', '2005-12-21 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968222, 269313, 6519, '<td valign="top">This poor guy looks like he has a darn good reason to fear drowning....looks way past a phobia (i.e. an unfounded fear). <br/>Very nice colors, but I don''t care for the very chunky border.</td>', 'This poor guy looks like he has a darn good reason to fear drowning....looks way past a phobia (i.e. an unfounded fear). Very nice colors, but I don''t care for the very chunky border.', '2005-12-21 13:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968226, 271328, 6519, '<td valign="top">Cute cat, but I see no fear depicted in this image.</td>', 'Cute cat, but I see no fear depicted in this image.', '2005-12-21 13:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968243, 269583, 6519, '<td valign="top">What is she scared of? She looks very relaxed and comfortable. I don''t see any fear depicted in this image. Nice photo, though.</td>', 'What is she scared of? She looks very relaxed and comfortable. I don''t see any fear depicted in this image. Nice photo, though.', '2005-12-21 13:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968255, 270953, 46870, '<td valign="top">nice shot i give 10</td>', 'nice shot i give 10', '2005-12-21 14:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968257, 270440, 6519, '<td valign="top">ROTFLMAO - thanks for the giggle. What a refreshing way to get the concept across. Love it!!</td>', 'ROTFLMAO - thanks for the giggle. What a refreshing way to get the concept across. Love it!!', '2005-12-21 14:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968266, 270217, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, I gave only 1 ten in the challenge...and this is it.  congrats on a very disturbing picture.  It''s blue to me...</td>', 'Well, I gave only 1 ten in the challenge...and this is it.  congrats on a very disturbing picture.  It''s blue to me...', '2005-12-21 14:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968272, 270953, 40718, '<td valign="top">I gave 1 ten and 1 nine in this challenge.  This is the 9, so I guess you get red in my book.  Well done in execution and creativity.  Looks like it took some work, but was fun to shoot.  I do get the sense of fear in this one.  I''m assuming "taphephobia" is the fear of being buried alive...</td>', 'I gave 1 ten and 1 nine in this challenge.  This is the 9, so I guess you get red in my book.  Well done in execution and creativity.  Looks like it took some work, but was fun to shoot.  I do get the sense of fear in this one.  I''m assuming "taphephobia" is the fear of being buried alive...', '2005-12-21 14:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968278, 270446, 49949, '<td valign="top">This evoked a genuine fear reaction in me. A taller building would have probably been more effective.</td>', 'This evoked a genuine fear reaction in me. A taller building would have probably been more effective.', '2005-12-21 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968279, 269449, 40718, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a person in the midst of the birds with his/her hands over their head or on their ears.  Would have conveyed the phobia a bit  better.  However, I still like the frenetic nature of the shot and gave it an 8.  That''s one of the top 4 shots in this challenge as far as my voting goes.  Well done.</td>', 'I wish there was a person in the midst of the birds with his/her hands over their head or on their ears.  Would have conveyed the phobia a bit  better.  However, I still like the frenetic nature of the shot and gave it an 8.  That''s one of the top 4 shots in this challenge as far as my voting goes.  Well done.', '2005-12-21 14:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968283, 270883, 49949, '<td valign="top">Made me cringe a bit. That''s the right reaction.</td>', 'Made me cringe a bit. That''s the right reaction.', '2005-12-21 14:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968286, 270600, 45790, '<td valign="top">Yep, I can see the fear here.  Good job. Poor kid!</td>', 'Yep, I can see the fear here.  Good job. Poor kid!', '2005-12-21 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968287, 269583, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, my wife didn''t like this one so much (she felt the nudity was gratuitous).  I did.  I think the extended neck and the grasping of the sheet lend a feeling of the fear.  The title might hammer you due to Challenge requirements, but I''m not going to vote you down for that.  I assume it''s a fear of hanging.  The technicals and lighting are well done too. I give it an 8 which is one of the 4 highest scores in this challenge from me.</td>', 'Well, my wife didn''t like this one so much (she felt the nudity was gratuitous).  I did.  I think the extended neck and the grasping of the sheet lend a feeling of the fear.  The title might hammer you due to Challenge requirements, but I''m not going to vote you down for that.  I assume it''s a fear of hanging.  The technicals and lighting are well done too. I give it an 8 which is one of the 4 highest scores in this challenge from me.', '2005-12-21 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968288, 270953, 49949, '<td valign="top">Pretty scary for me.</td>', 'Pretty scary for me.', '2005-12-21 14:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968298, 271286, 45790, '<td valign="top">Yes, very scary. Lighting and grain add greatly to this one. I didn''t realize this was a mirror at first, until I looked up Eisoptrophobia.</td>', 'Yes, very scary. Lighting and grain add greatly to this one. I didn''t realize this was a mirror at first, until I looked up Eisoptrophobia.', '2005-12-21 14:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968301, 270877, 38549, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!, you were in the right spot at the perfect time.</td>', 'WOW!!!!, you were in the right spot at the perfect time.', '2005-12-21 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968303, 270556, 45790, '<td valign="top">Rhytiphobia? You don''t say, and this one, while good technically, doesn''t come across as "fear".</td>', 'Rhytiphobia? You don''t say, and this one, while good technically, doesn''t come across as "fear".', '2005-12-21 14:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968306, 269723, 48739, '<td valign="top">Scarry! i dont know if those light gave it a blur but its a little fuzzy. Nice idea.</td>', 'Scarry! i dont know if those light gave it a blur but its a little fuzzy. Nice idea.', '2005-12-21 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968311, 271087, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF, but would be nicer with plain background. Anyway it does convey the fear.</td>', 'Good use of DOF, but would be nicer with plain background. Anyway it does convey the fear.', '2005-12-21 14:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968325, 269141, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''m not claustrophobic, but this one is scary and conveys it well. Good lighting and focus, and of course the framing is very important for this one!<br/></td>', 'I''m not claustrophobic, but this one is scary and conveys it well. Good lighting and focus, and of course the framing is very important for this one!', '2005-12-21 14:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968328, 271343, 45790, '<td valign="top">Strikes me as more humorous than fearful. I wonder how you made it?</td>', 'Strikes me as more humorous than fearful. I wonder how you made it?', '2005-12-21 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968332, 271012, 48739, '<td valign="top">Love the long alley!! like nevering pics nice shot.</td>', 'Love the long alley!! like nevering pics nice shot.', '2005-12-21 14:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968334, 270367, 45790, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the is a phobia, but it does convey the feeling. I think I''ll move on to the next picture quickly! Good work!</td>', 'Not sure if the is a phobia, but it does convey the feeling. I think I''ll move on to the next picture quickly! Good work!', '2005-12-21 14:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968340, 269873, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the blue streaks, are they supposed to represent the odor? I don''t think they are necessary...... your assorted bottles and the model''s action explains it all. Thank you for making the effort to actually depict a fear.</td>', 'I don''t get the blue streaks, are they supposed to represent the odor? I don''t think they are necessary...... your assorted bottles and the model''s action explains it all. Thank you for making the effort to actually depict a fear.', '2005-12-21 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968343, 271062, 48739, '<td valign="top">Really bright. Had to look at for a min.</td>', 'Really bright. Had to look at for a min.', '2005-12-21 14:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968347, 270473, 45790, '<td valign="top">Actually very pleasant looking. Sharp image and I expect "infrared". Stands up well on it''s merits, but just not for the challenge description "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."</td>', 'Actually very pleasant looking. Sharp image and I expect "infrared". Stands up well on it''s merits, but just not for the challenge description "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."', '2005-12-21 14:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968351, 271092, 48739, '<td valign="top">Nice expression!</td>', 'Nice expression!', '2005-12-21 14:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968354, 270953, 48739, '<td valign="top">Wow thats deep =) love it!</td>', 'Wow thats deep =) love it!', '2005-12-21 14:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968355, 270933, 48739, '<td valign="top">A doll like Chucky would of worked for this one....Nice shot</td>', 'A doll like Chucky would of worked for this one....Nice shot', '2005-12-21 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968356, 270557, 45790, '<td valign="top">Speedometer shows you were traveling 5 and 15 mph (traffic tieup?) So that pretty much negates the fear of speed! If you cropped the speedometer out, you score would improve IMO.</td>', 'Speedometer shows you were traveling 5 and 15 mph (traffic tieup?) So that pretty much negates the fear of speed! If you cropped the speedometer out, you score would improve IMO.', '2005-12-21 14:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968361, 270557, 48739, '<td valign="top">Kinda cool witht he bumper of a tuck right in your face!! Took me a min tyo see it Nice pic.</td>', 'Kinda cool witht he bumper of a tuck right in your face!! Took me a min tyo see it Nice pic.', '2005-12-21 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968362, 270501, 6519, '<td valign="top">Well no wonder..... looks like she has good reason to fear it at present.<br/>A phobia is actually an irrational fear, not a perfectly reasonable concern (and someone with a phobia would NOT put themselves in such a precarious postion).<br/>However,  I appreciate you making the effort to depict fear.</td>', 'Well no wonder..... looks like she has good reason to fear it at present.A phobia is actually an irrational fear, not a perfectly reasonable concern (and someone with a phobia would NOT put themselves in such a precarious postion).However,  I appreciate you making the effort to depict fear.', '2005-12-21 14:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968370, 270883, 48739, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection off water!! NIce capture! thats a keeper.Might trim the grass a bit just a little.</td>', 'Nice reflection off water!! NIce capture! thats a keeper.Might trim the grass a bit just a little.', '2005-12-21 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968375, 270473, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any fear depicted in this image. Lovely photo, though!</td>', 'I don''t see any fear depicted in this image. Lovely photo, though!', '2005-12-21 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968377, 270953, 43434, '<td valign="top">fantastic .. this really shows what the challenge was.  Met in every way. 9.</td>', 'fantastic .. this really shows what the challenge was.  Met in every way. 9.', '2005-12-21 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968382, 270953, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like it.  I hope you bought her dinner for getting dirty for ya.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like it.  I hope you bought her dinner for getting dirty for ya.', '2005-12-21 14:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968385, 270217, 6519, '<td valign="top">Instead of just making me feel someone else''s fear, you are actually INSTILLING it in me. I wouldn''t be surprised if I ended up with coulrophobia myself after looking at this pic. Well done!!!</td>', 'Instead of just making me feel someone else''s fear, you are actually INSTILLING it in me. I wouldn''t be surprised if I ended up with coulrophobia myself after looking at this pic. Well done!!!', '2005-12-21 14:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968387, 270217, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great!  Now I won''t be able to sleep for a week.  Well done.</td>', 'Great!  Now I won''t be able to sleep for a week.  Well done.', '2005-12-21 14:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968395, 271076, 39880, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture.  Looks like it took some work.  Well done.</td>', 'Interesting picture.  Looks like it took some work.  Well done.', '2005-12-21 14:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968396, 270252, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you''re allowed to use two different images, but I''ll vote as if this was legal, anyway.</td>', 'I don''t think you''re allowed to use two different images, but I''ll vote as if this was legal, anyway.', '2005-12-21 14:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968407, 271076, 6519, '<td valign="top">Your effort is admirable, the expression very good, composition great, lighting dramatic, stark b&amp;w treatment very suitable - can you tell I like this a lot?<br/>On top of all that, you even read and followed the challenge description. Well done!!!! 10</td>', 'Your effort is admirable, the expression very good, composition great, lighting dramatic, stark b&w treatment very suitable - can you tell I like this a lot?On top of all that, you even read and followed the challenge description. Well done!!!! 10', '2005-12-21 14:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968411, 269583, 31533, '<td valign="top">Dude, this is a nice photograph but I think you failed to meet the challenge...</td>', 'Dude, this is a nice photograph but I think you failed to meet the challenge...', '2005-12-21 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968415, 270611, 6519, '<td valign="top">LOL you certainly made an effort to depict a fear!!</td>', 'LOL you certainly made an effort to depict a fear!!', '2005-12-21 14:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968421, 269723, 6519, '<td valign="top">Looks more like active worship/participation  than a phobia to me. I don''t get the "fear" feeling here, but I like the photo.</td>', 'Looks more like active worship/participation  than a phobia to me. I don''t get the "fear" feeling here, but I like the photo.', '2005-12-21 14:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968434, 271305, 6519, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but you''ll lose points because it doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo, but you''ll lose points because it doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2005-12-21 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968440, 271350, 45790, '<td valign="top">I have trouble watching movies where dolls come alive ("Chucky" is the worst case) because I do find them menacing. However all these dolls when they are "alive" have weapons and their faces turn "evil". Alas, nothing like that is happening here, and this just looks like a snoopy doll photographed with bad lighting and focus.<br/></td>', 'I have trouble watching movies where dolls come alive ("Chucky" is the worst case) because I do find them menacing. However all these dolls when they are "alive" have weapons and their faces turn "evil". Alas, nothing like that is happening here, and this just looks like a snoopy doll photographed with bad lighting and focus.', '2005-12-21 14:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968446, 271092, 6519, '<td valign="top">Stunning. <br/>We need a Woody fanclub with regular Woody challenges. Ken is NOT allowed to enter any of them.<br/>Well done, you positioned Mr Plastic so well, I am really feeling his fear. 9</td>', 'Stunning. We need a Woody fanclub with regular Woody challenges. Ken is NOT allowed to enter any of them.Well done, you positioned Mr Plastic so well, I am really feeling his fear. 9', '2005-12-21 14:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968447, 271163, 45790, '<td valign="top">The bag is so small in the frame that it took a second for me to figure out what was going on here. I don''t know whether to be more frightened about the "bomb"" in the bag, or that you might have been arrested for staging this shot!<br/></td>', 'The bag is so small in the frame that it took a second for me to figure out what was going on here. I don''t know whether to be more frightened about the "bomb"" in the bag, or that you might have been arrested for staging this shot!', '2005-12-21 14:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968450, 270805, 45790, '<td valign="top">Murky stagnant water makes for an ugly shot but doesn''t convey fear to me, nor does this look like a flood.</td>', 'Murky stagnant water makes for an ugly shot but doesn''t convey fear to me, nor does this look like a flood.', '2005-12-21 15:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968455, 270992, 45790, '<td valign="top">I just commented on an entry that was on fear of dolls, but wasn''t scary. *Yours* is very scary. I can see that gnome coming to life and blowing up my house. Good work with the photograph, but title is a bit long.</td>', 'I just commented on an entry that was on fear of dolls, but wasn''t scary. *Yours* is very scary. I can see that gnome coming to life and blowing up my house. Good work with the photograph, but title is a bit long.', '2005-12-21 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968457, 271098, 45790, '<td valign="top">Totally out of focus and blurred.</td>', 'Totally out of focus and blurred.', '2005-12-21 15:03:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1968458, 270440, 45790, '<td valign="top">Humorous and doesn''t convey any fear -- "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."</td>', 'Humorous and doesn''t convey any fear -- "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."', '2005-12-21 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968459, 271124, 45790, '<td valign="top">I''d run but I''m afraid he would catch me! Good lighting and use of grain.<br/></td>', 'I''d run but I''m afraid he would catch me! Good lighting and use of grain.', '2005-12-21 15:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968464, 269735, 45790, '<td valign="top">While it is foreboding, the picture is fuzzy. What is in focus here? I''d like the house sharp, as though it were inviting the viewer inside (to their death?).</td>', 'While it is foreboding, the picture is fuzzy. What is in focus here? I''d like the house sharp, as though it were inviting the viewer inside (to their death?).', '2005-12-21 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968466, 270798, 48739, '<td valign="top">Makes me tingle. that feeling you get when you really high in the air! i like it .</td>', 'Makes me tingle. that feeling you get when you really high in the air! i like it .', '2005-12-21 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968467, 269427, 45790, '<td valign="top">Fear of frosty space? It looks like it might be warm inside. I don''t get this one.</td>', 'Fear of frosty space? It looks like it might be warm inside. I don''t get this one.', '2005-12-21 15:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968472, 270285, 16950, '<td valign="top">Wow, is that sky for real?  What a bizzare color!  Love this shot.</td>', 'Wow, is that sky for real?  What a bizzare color!  Love this shot.', '2005-12-21 15:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968473, 270523, 48739, '<td valign="top">Nice Image!</td>', 'Nice Image!', '2005-12-21 15:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968475, 269449, 48739, '<td valign="top">Great!!</td>', 'Great!!', '2005-12-21 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968478, 269282, 46448, '<td valign="top">Good composition, the use of B/W really brings it out. The expression is right on.</td>', 'Good composition, the use of B/W really brings it out. The expression is right on.', '2005-12-21 15:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968479, 270470, 45790, '<td valign="top">It would help if he were obviously looking up.</td>', 'It would help if he were obviously looking up.', '2005-12-21 15:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968483, 269456, 45790, '<td valign="top">This *almost* works for me. The duck can be seen. The picture is grainy. The girl is fending off the attack. But she doesn''t look that frightened. And this borders on humor, which makes it difficult to be fearful. (Thinking here of "Attack of the Killer Tomatoes")</td>', 'This *almost* works for me. The duck can be seen. The picture is grainy. The girl is fending off the attack. But she doesn''t look that frightened. And this borders on humor, which makes it difficult to be fearful. (Thinking here of "Attack of the Killer Tomatoes")', '2005-12-21 15:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968488, 271315, 6519, '<td valign="top">I see a snake (or at least part of one), but I see no fear depicted in this image. <br/>The focus could be better and the DOF is a bit too shallow for my liking. The fingers (?) on the right are distracting, as is the very bright triangle of light.<br/>I do like your model, though :-)</td>', 'I see a snake (or at least part of one), but I see no fear depicted in this image. The focus could be better and the DOF is a bit too shallow for my liking. The fingers (?) on the right are distracting, as is the very bright triangle of light.I do like your model, though :-)', '2005-12-21 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968490, 271233, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good angle. Were you trampled after the shot was taken? Looks like motion blur of horse on right, which is effective here. Horse on left is too shadowed and mane blocks the face, which is unfortunate.</td>', 'Good angle. Were you trampled after the shot was taken? Looks like motion blur of horse on right, which is effective here. Horse on left is too shadowed and mane blocks the face, which is unfortunate.', '2005-12-21 15:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968493, 270437, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good angle and lighting. This is scary.</td>', 'Good angle and lighting. This is scary.', '2005-12-21 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968497, 270918, 6519, '<td valign="top">OMG, where is THAT? This is a very amazing display, but surely if someone had a phobia about their bill, they wouldn''t DO this, would they?<br/>DNMC, but fascinating photo anyway.</td>', 'OMG, where is THAT? This is a very amazing display, but surely if someone had a phobia about their bill, they wouldn''t DO this, would they?DNMC, but fascinating photo anyway.', '2005-12-21 15:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968504, 270408, 48739, '<td valign="top">Well its a good shot!! But title a little off hate is a little different than a phobia. The tie make me laugh =)</td>', 'Well its a good shot!! But title a little off hate is a little different than a phobia. The tie make me laugh =)', '2005-12-21 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968507, 271223, 31403, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo with a horrible border - black was invented for borders  ;-)  8</td>', 'beautiful photo with a horrible border - black was invented for borders  ;-)  8', '2005-12-21 15:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968509, 269873, 45790, '<td valign="top">You picked a tough one since there is no way to provide a "scratch and sniff" card with your entry. The blue "odor" isn''t necessary (since phobias are irrational fears it isn''t necessary to have any odor at all) and is distracting. Just surrounding him with the colognes and having him sniff his underarm would have sufficed.</td>', 'You picked a tough one since there is no way to provide a "scratch and sniff" card with your entry. The blue "odor" isn''t necessary (since phobias are irrational fears it isn''t necessary to have any odor at all) and is distracting. Just surrounding him with the colognes and having him sniff his underarm would have sufficed.', '2005-12-21 15:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968513, 270623, 45790, '<td valign="top">Fear of mannequins? This picture isn''t scary. Now if it were poised to attack, that would be different.</td>', 'Fear of mannequins? This picture isn''t scary. Now if it were poised to attack, that would be different.', '2005-12-21 15:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968515, 269938, 45790, '<td valign="top">Photophobia, to be precise. But film cannot think and thus cannot fear the light. And nothing in this picture makes me fear light.</td>', 'Photophobia, to be precise. But film cannot think and thus cannot fear the light. And nothing in this picture makes me fear light.', '2005-12-21 15:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968516, 271362, 45790, '<td valign="top">But she appears to be smiling. Not fearful at all. "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."</td>', 'But she appears to be smiling. Not fearful at all. "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."', '2005-12-21 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968525, 271345, 6519, '<td valign="top">Fabulous effort and a very pretty photo.</td>', 'Fabulous effort and a very pretty photo.', '2005-12-21 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968527, 270217, 48739, '<td valign="top">Scarey! i like it!! Now i need to go through 5 more years of counseling......thanks!! =) Nice shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-31 12:04:00.</i></td>', 'Scarey! i like it!! Now i need to go through 5 more years of counseling......thanks!! =) Nice shot.', '2005-12-21 15:31:58.000000', '2005-12-31 12:04:00.000000', 1),
(1968534, 269583, 45790, '<td valign="top">So is this fear of Brigitte, perhaps Caligynephobia (fear of beautiful women) or Gynophobia (fear of women)? Or maybe Pnigophobia (fear of choking). I really don''t know what the phobia is and can''t say that it "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."</td>', 'So is this fear of Brigitte, perhaps Caligynephobia (fear of beautiful women) or Gynophobia (fear of women)? Or maybe Pnigophobia (fear of choking). I really don''t know what the phobia is and can''t say that it "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."', '2005-12-21 15:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968539, 270405, 6519, '<td valign="top">I like the effort you made with your cloud and the fact that you read the challenge description - you named your phobia in the title AND you are actually depicting fear. Well done!<br/>The reflections on your model''s glasses are bothering me, but you came up with an original  idea.</td>', 'I like the effort you made with your cloud and the fact that you read the challenge description - you named your phobia in the title AND you are actually depicting fear. Well done!The reflections on your model''s glasses are bothering me, but you came up with an original  idea.', '2005-12-21 15:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968543, 270953, 46448, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! good emotive capture here, I got the feel of being buried.</td>', 'Nicely done! good emotive capture here, I got the feel of being buried.', '2005-12-21 15:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968544, 270349, 45790, '<td valign="top">Pretty anemic glaring light. I''d have expected a brightly lit scene, perhaps with lots of blown highlights, to show the fear.</td>', 'Pretty anemic glaring light. I''d have expected a brightly lit scene, perhaps with lots of blown highlights, to show the fear.', '2005-12-21 15:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968548, 270357, 45790, '<td valign="top">How does a frozen water fall convey the fear of "rivers of running water"? Doesn''t for me. Nice waterfall, though!</td>', 'How does a frozen water fall convey the fear of "rivers of running water"? Doesn''t for me. Nice waterfall, though!', '2005-12-21 15:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968550, 270695, 6519, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Vitalstatistix, the chief in the Asterix books. His main concern was that the sky could fall on his head.<br/>Interesting take on the phobia and nice photo.</td>', 'This reminds me of Vitalstatistix, the chief in the Asterix books. His main concern was that the sky could fall on his head.Interesting take on the phobia and nice photo.', '2005-12-21 15:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968558, 269967, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is terrific. Between the freaked out look, the odd perspective  and the background blur, the whole pic is very convincing. I like the sepia treatment in this, too, and your title is close enough to requirements to get away with it. 8</td>', 'This is terrific. Between the freaked out look, the odd perspective  and the background blur, the whole pic is very convincing. I like the sepia treatment in this, too, and your title is close enough to requirements to get away with it. 8', '2005-12-21 15:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968562, 270647, 45790, '<td valign="top">Cute, joyful child doesn''t convey any fear. "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear." isn''t done by this or could by by any picture showing wetness. The title doesn''t make anything better -- perhaps you could showing him unhappy being dried off with a towel near the sprinkler/fountain? But still wouldn''t be a fear.</td>', 'Cute, joyful child doesn''t convey any fear. "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear." isn''t done by this or could by by any picture showing wetness. The title doesn''t make anything better -- perhaps you could showing him unhappy being dried off with a towel near the sprinkler/fountain? But still wouldn''t be a fear.', '2005-12-21 15:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968563, 271248, 6519, '<td valign="top">It would have made more sense to pick some innocent shadow - like that of a tree - because a phobia is an irrational fear, not sensible concern over a real threat.<br/>However, you DID depict fear, give a proper title, and generally made an effort. 7</td>', 'It would have made more sense to pick some innocent shadow - like that of a tree - because a phobia is an irrational fear, not sensible concern over a real threat.However, you DID depict fear, give a proper title, and generally made an effort. 7', '2005-12-21 15:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968565, 270918, 45790, '<td valign="top">Works in its own way. Nice shot. Hard to resist not giving it a good score even though the image itself doesn''t "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."</td>', 'Works in its own way. Nice shot. Hard to resist not giving it a good score even though the image itself doesn''t "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear."', '2005-12-21 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968566, 271286, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yup, I''m feeling the fear - you''re right on topic.<br/>The very grainy b&amp;w treatment is perfect for this shot.8</td>', 'Yup, I''m feeling the fear - you''re right on topic.The very grainy b&w treatment is perfect for this shot.8', '2005-12-21 15:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968577, 271290, 6519, '<td valign="top">Well done, you conveyed a big idea simply by showing a part of a clenched fist and a small cross. The finger/thumb in the forground (lower left hand corner) bothers me, and the composition could be a little better,  but I love the harsh lighting - it is very effective for this pic.</td>', 'Well done, you conveyed a big idea simply by showing a part of a clenched fist and a small cross. The finger/thumb in the forground (lower left hand corner) bothers me, and the composition could be a little better,  but I love the harsh lighting - it is very effective for this pic.', '2005-12-21 15:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968578, 271304, 45790, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really convey the fear. Foreground is out of focus.</td>', 'Doesn''t really convey the fear. Foreground is out of focus.', '2005-12-21 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968584, 271087, 19672, '<td valign="top">Sheesh, did you want this in phobia or Shallow DOF ?</td>', 'Sheesh, did you want this in phobia or Shallow DOF ?', '2005-12-21 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968587, 269756, 45790, '<td valign="top">If the man weren''t blurred and if the gun were aimed at me, then I''d be scared! As it is, it isn''t conveying fear. Also the only portion of the image that is clear is the back wall.</td>', 'If the man weren''t blurred and if the gun were aimed at me, then I''d be scared! As it is, it isn''t conveying fear. Also the only portion of the image that is clear is the back wall.', '2005-12-21 15:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968590, 269969, 45790, '<td valign="top">Nothing conveys fear. It''s just a picture of an old biplane. A good picture, though.</td>', 'Nothing conveys fear. It''s just a picture of an old biplane. A good picture, though.', '2005-12-21 15:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968598, 270933, 45790, '<td valign="top">This is suggestive of a sinister doll, thanks mainly to the framing. It''s holding a knife below the frame, I expect. I''m amazed how effective it is -- it what you don''t see that scares you.</td>', 'This is suggestive of a sinister doll, thanks mainly to the framing. It''s holding a knife below the frame, I expect. I''m amazed how effective it is -- it what you don''t see that scares you.', '2005-12-21 15:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968605, 270793, 45790, '<td valign="top">If they were flying straight towards me, I''d be scared. As it is, it''s just a picture of sea birds either late or early in the day.</td>', 'If they were flying straight towards me, I''d be scared. As it is, it''s just a picture of sea birds either late or early in the day.', '2005-12-21 15:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1968613, 271284, 45790, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t convey "alone" with all those cars down there. Fence doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Just doesn''t convey "alone" with all those cars down there. Fence doesn''t do it for me.', '2005-12-21 15:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
