(1968704, 269141, 40718, '<td valign="top">Good job.  I wanted to do claustrophobia myself, but just couldn''t come up with a good composition.  This is excellent.  Flipping the picture (I''m assuming) does a good job of adding a sense of unease.  The technicals are well done too. 7</td>', 'Good job.  I wanted to do claustrophobia myself, but just couldn''t come up with a good composition.  This is excellent.  Flipping the picture (I''m assuming) does a good job of adding a sense of unease.  The technicals are well done too. 7', '2005-12-21 16:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
