(1968842, 270440, 44490, '<td valign="top">Humorous - "kayaker" seems to be a proper word, but it sure sounds loquacious.  Wish that the kayaker were further to the left and out of the distraction of the brush.</td>', 'Humorous - "kayaker" seems to be a proper word, but it sure sounds loquacious.  Wish that the kayaker were further to the left and out of the distraction of the brush.', '2005-12-21 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
