(1968864, 270285, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting architecture and effective feeling.  The color seems to be a bit overdone, but I still like it.</td>', 'Interesting architecture and effective feeling.  The color seems to be a bit overdone, but I still like it.', '2005-12-21 17:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
