(1970933, 271293, 10413, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  The water hose (or wahtever it is) is somewhat distracting to me but other than that it''s very well done.  One of my higher scores.</td>', 'Nice shot!  The water hose (or wahtever it is) is somewhat distracting to me but other than that it''s very well done.  One of my higher scores.', '2005-12-22 10:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970938, 270357, 10413, '<td valign="top">Breath taking shot.  It''s too pretty for me to feel any fear from it.  Still a higher scorer for me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 13:37:03.</i></td>', 'Breath taking shot.  It''s too pretty for me to feel any fear from it.  Still a higher scorer for me.', '2005-12-22 10:30:17.000000', '2005-12-28 13:37:03.000000', 1),
(1970973, 269286, 43565, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the towel and the overall darkness of the image, but I think the floss should be more in focus.</td>', 'I like the texture of the towel and the overall darkness of the image, but I think the floss should be more in focus.', '2005-12-22 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1970998, 271012, 45790, '<td valign="top">Effective photo.</td>', 'Effective photo.', '2005-12-22 10:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971001, 270731, 45790, '<td valign="top">Picture seems fuzzy and railing is a distraction.</td>', 'Picture seems fuzzy and railing is a distraction.', '2005-12-22 10:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971003, 271238, 15538, '<td valign="top">The picture is a bit out of focus</td>', 'The picture is a bit out of focus', '2005-12-22 11:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971004, 269411, 45790, '<td valign="top">I had to look up Gephyrophobia to figure out what the fear was, and then I noticed the bridge which is small, short, and might not be a bridge at all -- you can''t really tell. The challenge description states "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear". This doesn''t do it. The pastoral landscape and tinting doesn''t help either.</td>', 'I had to look up Gephyrophobia to figure out what the fear was, and then I noticed the bridge which is small, short, and might not be a bridge at all -- you can''t really tell. The challenge description states "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear". This doesn''t do it. The pastoral landscape and tinting doesn''t help either.', '2005-12-22 11:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971010, 270523, 45790, '<td valign="top">In this case the subject, the tunnel, is obscured by the left wall, and there is too much of the foreground, especially the graffitti, as a distraction. A shot taken much closer would have been far more effective.</td>', 'In this case the subject, the tunnel, is obscured by the left wall, and there is too much of the foreground, especially the graffitti, as a distraction. A shot taken much closer would have been far more effective.', '2005-12-22 11:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971013, 269967, 45790, '<td valign="top">Shallow DOF, the frightened man, and the sepia tone get the point across very well.</td>', 'Shallow DOF, the frightened man, and the sepia tone get the point across very well.', '2005-12-22 11:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971014, 269326, 45790, '<td valign="top">Open mouth is good, but poor focus is distracting and keeps it from being sinister, and thus making one fearful.</td>', 'Open mouth is good, but poor focus is distracting and keeps it from being sinister, and thus making one fearful.', '2005-12-22 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971019, 271368, 45790, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you meant "Doraphobia". But these aren''t animals. The picture is cute. Doesn''t "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear".</td>', 'Perhaps you meant "Doraphobia". But these aren''t animals. The picture is cute. Doesn''t "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear".', '2005-12-22 11:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971025, 270241, 45790, '<td valign="top">You must have made up that phobia since I''ve never seen/heard a loud flower. Of course the picture is not of a flower. Also there is nothing here that conveys the fear -- it''s just a nice fireworks picture.</td>', 'You must have made up that phobia since I''ve never seen/heard a loud flower. Of course the picture is not of a flower. Also there is nothing here that conveys the fear -- it''s just a nice fireworks picture.', '2005-12-22 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971031, 271292, 45790, '<td valign="top">He''s in a corner, but the ceiling could be very high (he isn''t up against it). Lighting and grain are effective, but light pattern on wall looks like blinds -- would be better if the pattern looked like bars!</td>', 'He''s in a corner, but the ceiling could be very high (he isn''t up against it). Lighting and grain are effective, but light pattern on wall looks like blinds -- would be better if the pattern looked like bars!', '2005-12-22 11:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971040, 270969, 45790, '<td valign="top">OK, lots of mirrors, but shell (not alive, not threatening) is probably not the best thing to have reflected to convey the fear.</td>', 'OK, lots of mirrors, but shell (not alive, not threatening) is probably not the best thing to have reflected to convey the fear.', '2005-12-22 11:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971043, 271028, 45790, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to portray a ghost. An ice sculpture just doesn''t do it. Interesting shot, though.</td>', 'It''s really hard to portray a ghost. An ice sculpture just doesn''t do it. Interesting shot, though.', '2005-12-22 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971046, 270446, 45790, '<td valign="top">If anything is going to work for this fear, it is an absolutely straight down shot. Excellent job with getting the DOF necessary to clearly see where one is going to land.</td>', 'If anything is going to work for this fear, it is an absolutely straight down shot. Excellent job with getting the DOF necessary to clearly see where one is going to land.', '2005-12-22 11:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971051, 271092, 45790, '<td valign="top">The plastic object is fearful of the wooden objects. However plastic objects can''t have feelings or emotions.  I alternate between thinking this is a really good job and thinking it is completely silly. I''ll give you a good score now -- it does work well as a cartoon.</td>', 'The plastic object is fearful of the wooden objects. However plastic objects can''t have feelings or emotions.  I alternate between thinking this is a really good job and thinking it is completely silly. I''ll give you a good score now -- it does work well as a cartoon.', '2005-12-22 11:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971053, 270723, 45790, '<td valign="top">The birds don''t see the cat and aren''t expressing any fear. So I think this fails "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear"</td>', 'The birds don''t see the cat and aren''t expressing any fear. So I think this fails "Try to make the viewer feel the emotion of the fear"', '2005-12-22 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971056, 270217, 45790, '<td valign="top">A very sinister clown! Good lighting.</td>', 'A very sinister clown! Good lighting.', '2005-12-22 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971066, 269583, 36606, '<td valign="top">very nice. but does it strike fear into me?</td>', 'very nice. but does it strike fear into me?', '2005-12-22 11:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971069, 270723, 36606, '<td valign="top">the kitty doesnt seem too fearful?</td>', 'the kitty doesnt seem too fearful?', '2005-12-22 11:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
