(1971083, 271076, 46634, '<td valign="top">only comment is that I can see some of the sticky paper on the nails. Other than that, great shot, and great way to express the phobia!</td>', 'only comment is that I can see some of the sticky paper on the nails. Other than that, great shot, and great way to express the phobia!', '2005-12-22 11:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
