(1971456, 270397, 16950, '<td valign="top">I just love this shot.  The mouse is so sharp, and looks menacing in that pose (tossed through the air?).  I was thinking "fear of mice", but Anthropophobia is fear of flowers.  Is it in the right challenge?  Would have been a good one for DOF also, which may have been your intention.  Either way, great shot!  9</td>', 'I just love this shot.  The mouse is so sharp, and looks menacing in that pose (tossed through the air?).  I was thinking "fear of mice", but Anthropophobia is fear of flowers.  Is it in the right challenge?  Would have been a good one for DOF also, which may have been your intention.  Either way, great shot!  9', '2005-12-22 14:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1971460, 270501, 16950, '<td valign="top">Very good!  One of the better conveyors of fear I have seen. 9</td>', 'Very good!  One of the better conveyors of fear I have seen. 9', '2005-12-22 14:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
