(1972657, 269842, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot and perspective.  Looks almost dead straight.  Criticism; angle adjustment to get it perfectly symmetrical if possible and perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom to allow the focus sharper ''sooner'' when ''looking upwards'' (if that makes sense), may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good shot and perspective.  Looks almost dead straight.  Criticism; angle adjustment to get it perfectly symmetrical if possible and perhaps a slightly tighter crop at the bottom to allow the focus sharper ''sooner'' when ''looking upwards'' (if that makes sense), may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 22:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972672, 270883, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture, nice ''fore'' and background bokeh, good color and reflection as well.  Criticism; think this has more potential (depending of course what you had to work with).  Firstly the 3 extra pixels would have helped (this is 637), also, a nudge rotation up on the left, (or even going the other way and more diagonal) and a variation in the cropping, and as mentioned the size, would have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good capture, nice ''fore'' and background bokeh, good color and reflection as well.  Criticism; think this has more potential (depending of course what you had to work with).  Firstly the 3 extra pixels would have helped (this is 637), also, a nudge rotation up on the left, (or even going the other way and more diagonal) and a variation in the cropping, and as mentioned the size, would have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972739, 270953, 49672, '<td valign="top">Fantastic...what an amazing set-up you built.</td>', 'Fantastic...what an amazing set-up you built.', '2005-12-22 23:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972743, 270217, 49672, '<td valign="top">This scares me.  9.</td>', 'This scares me.  9.', '2005-12-22 23:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972745, 269449, 49672, '<td valign="top">Hitchcock...9</td>', 'Hitchcock...9', '2005-12-22 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972748, 271253, 49672, '<td valign="top">One of the best in a challenge with many great entries.</td>', 'One of the best in a challenge with many great entries.', '2005-12-22 23:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972771, 270953, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Criticism; the horizontal framing works well, but perhaps for ''here'' and more impact, more height/''space'' at the top/bottom may have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Criticism; the horizontal framing works well, but perhaps for ''here'' and more impact, more height/''space'' at the top/bottom may have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972778, 270446, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good perspective and composition.  Criticism; not much, looks like it needs ''straightening'', but just may be the angle.  Coloring is good, as are the ''elements''; people grouped, bus, etc.  Maybe a slight crop variation may have helped make this even better, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good perspective and composition.  Criticism; not much, looks like it needs ''straightening'', but just may be the angle.  Coloring is good, as are the ''elements''; people grouped, bus, etc.  Maybe a slight crop variation may have helped make this even better, not sure.', '2005-12-22 23:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972787, 270357, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Coloring is good and the white control seems fairly good too.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a variation in the crop at the top.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Coloring is good and the white control seems fairly good too.  Criticism; not much, perhaps a variation in the crop at the top.', '2005-12-22 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972801, 270470, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good ''cold sweat capture''.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a little more in the frame, or just ''wider'' with some more space left/right, not sure.</td>', '6 - Good ''cold sweat capture''.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps a little more in the frame, or just ''wider'' with some more space left/right, not sure.', '2005-12-22 23:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972825, 269449, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Criticism; not much, depending what you had to work with, perhaps not cropped so tightly at the top.  Toning/b&amp;w is good, but perhaps a little more detail in/on the birds may have given this an extra element, not sure.  Maybe, especially for this Challenge, 640 height too, for added ''phobia effect'', may have given this even more impact in my opinion, but again, not sure.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Criticism; not much, depending what you had to work with, perhaps not cropped so tightly at the top.  Toning/b&w is good, but perhaps a little more detail in/on the birds may have given this an extra element, not sure.  Maybe, especially for this Challenge, 640 height too, for added ''phobia effect'', may have given this even more impact in my opinion, but again, not sure.', '2005-12-22 23:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972834, 270933, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; wish it were bigger (640).</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; wish it were bigger (640).', '2005-12-22 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972841, 271368, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - You''re going to be out of luck for those that haven''t seen Nemo.  Criticism; more attention paid to the ''tags'', lighting, angle, and crop, would all have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '3 - You''re going to be out of luck for those that haven''t seen Nemo.  Criticism; more attention paid to the ''tags'', lighting, angle, and crop, would all have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 23:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972870, 270731, 39850, '<td valign="top">3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case).  For added ''effect'', especially for this Challenge, a sharper perspective would have helped this in my opinion.  Difficult to discern at this size, but focus doesn''t seem very sharp.</td>', '3 - Good potential.  Criticism; needs to be bigger (640 width in this case).  For added ''effect'', especially for this Challenge, a sharper perspective would have helped this in my opinion.  Difficult to discern at this size, but focus doesn''t seem very sharp.', '2005-12-22 23:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972875, 271087, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Good use of shallow DOF.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps the dark area bottom left ''gone'', and being able to ''see'' the end of the syringe/needle, would have made this even better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good.  Good use of shallow DOF.  Criticism; difficult, perhaps the dark area bottom left ''gone'', and being able to ''see'' the end of the syringe/needle, would have made this even better in my opinion.', '2005-12-22 23:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972886, 271092, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good.  Good composition and poses.  Criticism; not much, looks like a bit of gamma issues in the ''plastic person'', but may be intentional.</td>', '8 - Good.  Good composition and poses.  Criticism; not much, looks like a bit of gamma issues in the ''plastic person'', but may be intentional.', '2005-12-23 00:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972906, 270403, 45672, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  This one does a good job of meeting the challenge.  A few specks of dust or fuzz, but I realize you couldn''t spot edit, so no biggie.  7</td>', 'Nice shot.  This one does a good job of meeting the challenge.  A few specks of dust or fuzz, but I realize you couldn''t spot edit, so no biggie.  7', '2005-12-23 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972913, 269955, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps lighting, trying to reduce the glare, may have made this better in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good.  Criticism; not much, perhaps lighting, trying to reduce the glare, may have made this better in my opinion.', '2005-12-23 00:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972914, 271356, 45672, '<td valign="top">This one is great.  Nice job with the lighting and grainy look.  The only thing is the molding that shows through the person standing in the room.  I orignally thought it was maybe his dad, but with the molding showing through, it appears to be a ghost.  If it were a ghost, why not make it much scarier?</td>', 'This one is great.  Nice job with the lighting and grainy look.  The only thing is the molding that shows through the person standing in the room.  I orignally thought it was maybe his dad, but with the molding showing through, it appears to be a ghost.  If it were a ghost, why not make it much scarier?', '2005-12-23 00:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972922, 270772, 45672, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really envoke much fear in the viewer.  The shot is pretty decent though.</td>', 'This doesn''t really envoke much fear in the viewer.  The shot is pretty decent though.', '2005-12-23 00:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972929, 270397, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good angle/perspective.  Criticism; according to ''the list'' your title is a fear of people or society, so ''who knows'' there.  If the tail were able to be incorporated and the ''specks'' not on (presumably) the glass, make this even better in my opinion. edit:read your comments, I ''get it'' now, but still, you portrayed a person ''in fear''; now if the mouse was cowering, screeching and holding a little broom - different story<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:27:21.</i></td>', '6 - Good angle/perspective.  Criticism; according to ''the list'' your title is a fear of people or society, so ''who knows'' there.  If the tail were able to be incorporated and the ''specks'' not on (presumably) the glass, make this even better in my opinion. edit:read your comments, I ''get it'' now, but still, you portrayed a person ''in fear''; now if the mouse was cowering, screeching and holding a little broom - different story', '2005-12-23 00:11:13.000000', '2005-12-28 20:27:21.000000', 1),
(1972933, 270502, 45672, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m not sure how this scares me.  I think we are all afraid of dying, but I''m not sure this fence scares me to death.  Maybe it''s the vast emptyness on the other side.  Anyway, this is actually a good photograph by technical aspects.  I can''t quite give you a great score though because it just doesn''t bring a lot of fear to the viewer.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m not sure how this scares me.  I think we are all afraid of dying, but I''m not sure this fence scares me to death.  Maybe it''s the vast emptyness on the other side.  Anyway, this is actually a good photograph by technical aspects.  I can''t quite give you a great score though because it just doesn''t bring a lot of fear to the viewer.', '2005-12-23 00:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972938, 270731, 45672, '<td valign="top">Well, this image looks interesting, but it is really fuzzy.  I bet standing on that bridge and looking into that hole is scary.  Nonetheless, I don''t think this one nailed the concept of scaring the viewer.</td>', 'Well, this image looks interesting, but it is really fuzzy.  I bet standing on that bridge and looking into that hole is scary.  Nonetheless, I don''t think this one nailed the concept of scaring the viewer.', '2005-12-23 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1972939, 271023, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Criticism; if the end of the syringe/needle was more dominant, perhaps with less ''squirt'' and more of a trickle, likely make this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in lighting also and as this is (presumably) a macro, attention to details like the ''fluff'', but minor. edit:wording<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 20:09:09.</i></td>', '6 - Good.  Criticism; if the end of the syringe/needle was more dominant, perhaps with less ''squirt'' and more of a trickle, likely make this better in my opinion.  Perhaps a variation in lighting also and as this is (presumably) a macro, attention to details like the ''fluff'', but minor. edit:wording', '2005-12-23 00:14:49.000000', '2005-12-28 20:09:09.000000', 1),
(1972947, 270437, 45672, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  This one would most definately scare someone who was afraid of trees.  This is one of the better ones I''ve seen in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  This one would most definately scare someone who was afraid of trees.  This is one of the better ones I''ve seen in the challenge.', '2005-12-23 00:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
