(1972993, 270437, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Nice shot, perspective and toning.  Criticism; difficult given the toning, but perhaps being able to see a bit of detail in the bark, etc - not sure though, as the silhouette effect is good.  Perhaps wider may have given it a little extra, especially at this size and also for the ''phobia'' effect.  Up to 8 from 7. edit:changed 7 to 8 at the beginning of comment<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-28 22:25:13.</i></td>', '8 - Nice shot, perspective and toning.  Criticism; difficult given the toning, but perhaps being able to see a bit of detail in the bark, etc - not sure though, as the silhouette effect is good.  Perhaps wider may have given it a little extra, especially at this size and also for the ''phobia'' effect.  Up to 8 from 7. edit:changed 7 to 8 at the beginning of comment', '2005-12-23 00:30:32.000000', '2005-12-28 22:25:13.000000', 1),
