(1974156, 270957, 32946, '<td valign="top">I''d say its a zombie rather than a phantom, but I like the grainy texture (is it sand? snow?). Nice job</td>', 'I''d say its a zombie rather than a phantom, but I like the grainy texture (is it sand? snow?). Nice job', '2005-12-23 15:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
