(1974260, 270974, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh MAN!!!!!!!    Don''t know much about Limnophobia. . .but this is a BREATHTAKING picture!!!!    Those blues.  They take me to another place.   Congratulations on just an amazing photo.</td>', 'Oh MAN!!!!!!!    Don''t know much about Limnophobia. . .but this is a BREATHTAKING picture!!!!    Those blues.  They take me to another place.   Congratulations on just an amazing photo.', '2005-12-23 16:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
