(1974301, 271123, 45961, '<td valign="top">I gave a 4 on this. I don''t see the phobia or anything that would provoke phobia to me. Well, maybe it''s because some people are terrified of love. Love is beautiful, and it''s creative what you made out of snow, so that''s how I gave you 3 points, and another 1 point for the effort of placing this shot in the challenge. Normally, small photos won''t score very well, so if you have the chance try using the 640 pixels. The composition isn''t great in the shot, and it''s still rather grainy. Try not to use the camera flash, it hurts the shot too much.</td>', 'I gave a 4 on this. I don''t see the phobia or anything that would provoke phobia to me. Well, maybe it''s because some people are terrified of love. Love is beautiful, and it''s creative what you made out of snow, so that''s how I gave you 3 points, and another 1 point for the effort of placing this shot in the challenge. Normally, small photos won''t score very well, so if you have the chance try using the 640 pixels. The composition isn''t great in the shot, and it''s still rather grainy. Try not to use the camera flash, it hurts the shot too much.', '2005-12-23 16:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1974912, 271076, 22734, '<td valign="top">Quite an undertaking with a striking end result. A.E. would have inhance it even further. A very good effort. I love it. Bumping up.</td>', 'Quite an undertaking with a striking end result. A.E. would have inhance it even further. A very good effort. I love it. Bumping up.', '2005-12-24 00:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
