(1976023, 271343, 30881, '<td valign="top">The almost black on white tends to make white glare at viewer, some blue by trunks should have been removed before shooting. Good idea for subject and overall layout.</td>', 'The almost black on white tends to make white glare at viewer, some blue by trunks should have been removed before shooting. Good idea for subject and overall layout.', '2005-12-24 16:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976035, 270731, 49773, '<td valign="top">hehe, I made the same pic when I was there, same composition, angle and spot...</td>', 'hehe, I made the same pic when I was there, same composition, angle and spot...', '2005-12-24 16:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976048, 270953, 10858, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge. Really emotive, and very well presented shot. I like the hopeless expression on her face. Just like the very second of giving up. I wish you a Merry Christmas, and a ribbon for this one! (10)</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge. Really emotive, and very well presented shot. I like the hopeless expression on her face. Just like the very second of giving up. I wish you a Merry Christmas, and a ribbon for this one! (10)', '2005-12-24 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976050, 271076, 10858, '<td valign="top">Really emotive! I love the eyes, the really-really don''t touch me looking. Black and white works well. Just a small issue, that the glueing is visible with a few of the screws. Hovewer, this shot touched me. Merry Christmas and good luck! (10)</td>', 'Really emotive! I love the eyes, the really-really don''t touch me looking. Black and white works well. Just a small issue, that the glueing is visible with a few of the screws. Hovewer, this shot touched me. Merry Christmas and good luck! (10)', '2005-12-24 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976057, 269141, 10858, '<td valign="top">Really the top shot of this challenge. Reminds me to the scene of Kill Bill II. when Uma Thurman is digged alive and wants to escape. The cropping works well with the subject of the photo, I feel breathless looking at your model struggling in such a small place. Maybe a bit more agressive helding of the hands would make me feel more crazy. Wiching you Merry Christmas and good luck. (10)</td>', 'Really the top shot of this challenge. Reminds me to the scene of Kill Bill II. when Uma Thurman is digged alive and wants to escape. The cropping works well with the subject of the photo, I feel breathless looking at your model struggling in such a small place. Maybe a bit more agressive helding of the hands would make me feel more crazy. Wiching you Merry Christmas and good luck. (10)', '2005-12-24 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976066, 270473, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I don''t really feel the fear in it, however, I love the angle you took, the blues of the sky and the whites on the tree and snowy ground. Lovely photo, for me, rather pleasant than fearful. (7)</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I don''t really feel the fear in it, however, I love the angle you took, the blues of the sky and the whites on the tree and snowy ground. Lovely photo, for me, rather pleasant than fearful. (7)', '2005-12-24 17:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976072, 270805, 10858, '<td valign="top">This subject could have given you many ideas for a creative shot. The consequences of the flood, or the power of he flood, shocking moments. Here, I feel the lack of fear, the photo is sad, but I don''t see anything that makes me fear of this water. Composition is a bit unclear, too. Photography is something where you only have visual devices to make others feel what you did, and you need to use your creativity 101% to get something stunning. I am sure you will succeed some other time. (2)</td>', 'This subject could have given you many ideas for a creative shot. The consequences of the flood, or the power of he flood, shocking moments. Here, I feel the lack of fear, the photo is sad, but I don''t see anything that makes me fear of this water. Composition is a bit unclear, too. Photography is something where you only have visual devices to make others feel what you did, and you need to use your creativity 101% to get something stunning. I am sure you will succeed some other time. (2)', '2005-12-24 17:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976099, 271062, 10858, '<td valign="top">This must have been a great idea, but somehow it was spoiled by the presentation. I see a scissor, a spotlight, cannot figure anything else, don''t see the connection of these things, the whites would be OK for the shock, but it rather takes away from the feeling for me, it''s too much... Sorry... (2)</td>', 'This must have been a great idea, but somehow it was spoiled by the presentation. I see a scissor, a spotlight, cannot figure anything else, don''t see the connection of these things, the whites would be OK for the shock, but it rather takes away from the feeling for me, it''s too much... Sorry... (2)', '2005-12-24 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976187, 270252, 45790, '<td valign="top">Looks more like Mysophobia to me. The sepia and grain add to the dirtyness. I''m not a mysophobe, but wouldn''t want to use that sink.<br/> <br/>Alas I expect this will be DQed because it appears to go beyond Basic Editing. ADDED -- great, it''s been validated! Good luck. Hope you explain how you did it.</td>', 'Looks more like Mysophobia to me. The sepia and grain add to the dirtyness. I''m not a mysophobe, but wouldn''t want to use that sink. Alas I expect this will be DQed because it appears to go beyond Basic Editing. ADDED -- great, it''s been validated! Good luck. Hope you explain how you did it.', '2005-12-24 19:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976231, 270953, 28299, '<td valign="top">Wow - what some people will immerse themselves in to get the shot!!! Very good, by the way!</td>', 'Wow - what some people will immerse themselves in to get the shot!!! Very good, by the way!', '2005-12-24 19:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976232, 270597, 28299, '<td valign="top">Probably one of the most common phobias ever!</td>', 'Probably one of the most common phobias ever!', '2005-12-24 19:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976236, 269449, 28299, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo, wow, I mean really!! (You didn''t get pooped on did you? LOL!) 10</td>', 'Amazing photo, wow, I mean really!! (You didn''t get pooped on did you? LOL!) 10', '2005-12-24 19:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976429, 270591, 42574, '<td valign="top">This image might have more impact if it were larger.</td>', 'This image might have more impact if it were larger.', '2005-12-24 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976445, 271290, 33400, '<td valign="top">Great focus. Nice take on the subject</td>', 'Great focus. Nice take on the subject', '2005-12-24 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976447, 271257, 33400, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - very clever.  However, I would have put the out-of- focus doll in the background.  She takes up too much of the pic to be so soft.</td>', 'I like the idea - very clever.  However, I would have put the out-of- focus doll in the background.  She takes up too much of the pic to be so soft.', '2005-12-24 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976448, 271248, 33400, '<td valign="top">What dreams may come...<br/> Very good take on the challenge.</td>', 'What dreams may come... Very good take on the challenge.', '2005-12-24 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976449, 270300, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Sort of dream-like, if that''s what you were going for.  (I''ve had this dream...)</td>', 'Very good.  Sort of dream-like, if that''s what you were going for.  (I''ve had this dream...)', '2005-12-24 23:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976452, 270437, 33400, '<td valign="top">Very cool pic.  I don''t know my phobias, so I have to guess on this one.  But I keep expecting a branch to reach out and grab me.</td>', 'Very cool pic.  I don''t know my phobias, so I have to guess on this one.  But I keep expecting a branch to reach out and grab me.', '2005-12-24 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976459, 270397, 33400, '<td valign="top">I know this iook (killed 26 last year)  Nasty little things..<br/>You have captured this challenge very well.  One of the best.</td>', 'I know this iook (killed 26 last year)  Nasty little things..You have captured this challenge very well.  One of the best.', '2005-12-24 23:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
