(1976588, 270461, 24976, '<td valign="top">might have been better if the nose or i guess mouth was in focus as well. but def a good capture and appropriate for the challenge. 8</td>', 'might have been better if the nose or i guess mouth was in focus as well. but def a good capture and appropriate for the challenge. 8', '2005-12-25 01:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
