(1976593, 270397, 24976, '<td valign="top">I dont know how you got that mouse there but this is scary/cool and perfect for the challenge. 10</td>', 'I dont know how you got that mouse there but this is scary/cool and perfect for the challenge. 10', '2005-12-25 01:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976605, 269834, 50071, '<td valign="top">The look on her face truely captures the feeling here. The hand comming from the great darkness is perfect. The purity of her clothing.... it all works together with the lighting... marvelous depiction of fear!</td>', 'The look on her face truely captures the feeling here. The hand comming from the great darkness is perfect. The purity of her clothing.... it all works together with the lighting... marvelous depiction of fear!', '2005-12-25 01:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976607, 270217, 50071, '<td valign="top">Ok so I''m a little biast as clowns have always scared the bajeebas out of me! But the colouring alone in this pic just adds to that curdled blood feeling that chills my spine. This is one scarey clown!! Excellent depitction!</td>', 'Ok so I''m a little biast as clowns have always scared the bajeebas out of me! But the colouring alone in this pic just adds to that curdled blood feeling that chills my spine. This is one scarey clown!! Excellent depitction!', '2005-12-25 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976613, 270502, 50071, '<td valign="top">Does the white represent the great unknown? I could conjure up fear form that, but really the feeling I get is more serenity, not fear from this image. Nice composition though, it would make a great CD cover image I think.</td>', 'Does the white represent the great unknown? I could conjure up fear form that, but really the feeling I get is more serenity, not fear from this image. Nice composition though, it would make a great CD cover image I think.', '2005-12-25 01:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976616, 270247, 50071, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''ve had this nightmare! Nice imagery here, you can sense what''s going to happen next and you want to stop it. A nice use of blur, however I would have like to see more sharpness on the legs of the unfortunate one.</td>', 'I''m sure I''ve had this nightmare! Nice imagery here, you can sense what''s going to happen next and you want to stop it. A nice use of blur, however I would have like to see more sharpness on the legs of the unfortunate one.', '2005-12-25 01:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976617, 271072, 50071, '<td valign="top">The blue tones contrasted with those evil orange eyes make this a great depiction. I find it hard to feel the fear for cats, however if I were to fear one this little guy''s stare would do it.</td>', 'The blue tones contrasted with those evil orange eyes make this a great depiction. I find it hard to feel the fear for cats, however if I were to fear one this little guy''s stare would do it.', '2005-12-25 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976619, 269282, 50071, '<td valign="top">Blank background intensifies the look of panic in the eye.</td>', 'Blank background intensifies the look of panic in the eye.', '2005-12-25 02:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976621, 271076, 50071, '<td valign="top">the patience needed to stick those nails onto a face gets my vote... oh and the look in the eye added with the nice dark lighting of course... well done.</td>', 'the patience needed to stick those nails onto a face gets my vote... oh and the look in the eye added with the nice dark lighting of course... well done.', '2005-12-25 02:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976622, 271257, 50071, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and thought. Most would just photograph someone in a tight spot... this is imaginative, bright and conveys the message well.</td>', 'Interesting concept and thought. Most would just photograph someone in a tight spot... this is imaginative, bright and conveys the message well.', '2005-12-25 02:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976624, 271293, 50071, '<td valign="top">I thin kher fear is rational enough... nice imagery, surprised this was allowed through, but I like the feeling of guilt. The industrial background also conveys the difficulty she is facing.</td>', 'I thin kher fear is rational enough... nice imagery, surprised this was allowed through, but I like the feeling of guilt. The industrial background also conveys the difficulty she is facing.', '2005-12-25 02:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976626, 270974, 50071, '<td valign="top">Nice hues. To me this image is peaceful but for a limnophobic person I can see how this would indeed terrify. I like the use of sillouetted imagery against the cool deep blues.</td>', 'Nice hues. To me this image is peaceful but for a limnophobic person I can see how this would indeed terrify. I like the use of sillouetted imagery against the cool deep blues.', '2005-12-25 02:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976641, 271076, 25355, '<td valign="top">Despite the kind of "prickly" subject, this is Top Ten for sure.</td>', 'Despite the kind of "prickly" subject, this is Top Ten for sure.', '2005-12-25 02:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976718, 270877, 3306, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. By you and the eagle!</td>', 'Awesome capture. By you and the eagle!', '2005-12-25 07:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976719, 269286, 3306, '<td valign="top">interesting artistic expression</td>', 'interesting artistic expression', '2005-12-25 07:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976720, 271161, 3306, '<td valign="top">Excellent suggestive concept of your subject. I like the camera angle.</td>', 'Excellent suggestive concept of your subject. I like the camera angle.', '2005-12-25 07:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976722, 271257, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea. I think I would have liked it better with the top part of the doll in front not in the picture. the suggestive nature of your picture would have worked very well with the subject placed in the lower right corner with alot of negative space but I like your concept very much.</td>', 'Very creative idea. I think I would have liked it better with the top part of the doll in front not in the picture. the suggestive nature of your picture would have worked very well with the subject placed in the lower right corner with alot of negative space but I like your concept very much.', '2005-12-25 07:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976725, 271240, 3306, '<td valign="top">Gettysburg? Nicely done.</td>', 'Gettysburg? Nicely done.', '2005-12-25 07:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976726, 270597, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, a student''s greatest fear. Nice idea but I think your picture is a little to cluttered with objects that have nothing to do with your theme. Maybe cropping in would help to get across your idea.</td>', 'Ah yes, a student''s greatest fear. Nice idea but I think your picture is a little to cluttered with objects that have nothing to do with your theme. Maybe cropping in would help to get across your idea.', '2005-12-25 07:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976727, 270600, 3306, '<td valign="top">Is this where it started? Good capture.</td>', 'Is this where it started? Good capture.', '2005-12-25 07:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976729, 271345, 3306, '<td valign="top">Creatively set up. Technically well done. Good job.</td>', 'Creatively set up. Technically well done. Good job.', '2005-12-25 07:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976731, 269449, 49969, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo but i do not get a sense of phobia here. Gotta stick to the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice photo but i do not get a sense of phobia here. Gotta stick to the challenge.', '2005-12-25 07:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976732, 270446, 31794, '<td valign="top">the fear of hight is called Acrophobia, I think that''s what you are trying to show. nice shot, I like how the pipe gives a leading line down the building.</td>', 'the fear of hight is called Acrophobia, I think that''s what you are trying to show. nice shot, I like how the pipe gives a leading line down the building.', '2005-12-25 07:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
