(1976737, 271161, 49969, '<td valign="top">i rather like this one. Very nice lighting and colours to begin with. The subtle implication of the chair in the foreground being turned away from the other chairs is well conceived.</td>', 'i rather like this one. Very nice lighting and colours to begin with. The subtle implication of the chair in the foreground being turned away from the other chairs is well conceived.', '2005-12-25 07:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976738, 271240, 49969, '<td valign="top">Not nearly spooky enough to illustrate what you wrote in the caption.</td>', 'Not nearly spooky enough to illustrate what you wrote in the caption.', '2005-12-25 07:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976739, 270357, 31794, '<td valign="top">if it weren''t raining so much here in Iceland I''d say this was an icelandic picture... maby from the northern part of the country.. think there''s still some snow there :)<br/>like the shot, could also be fear of cold...</td>', 'if it weren''t raining so much here in Iceland I''d say this was an icelandic picture... maby from the northern part of the country.. think there''s still some snow there :)like the shot, could also be fear of cold...', '2005-12-25 07:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1976740, 270202, 49969, '<td valign="top">Like many other entries, this is a nicely taken picture but loses the meaning on me. It conveys a meaning in a very literal and blunt way but does little to convince its viewers of that meaning.</td>', 'Like many other entries, this is a nicely taken picture but loses the meaning on me. It conveys a meaning in a very literal and blunt way but does little to convince its viewers of that meaning.', '2005-12-25 07:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
