(1980782, 271123, 41675, '<td valign="top">I truly hope you don''t have a phobia of love - that would be sad. A good concept, but the coloring is a bit odd. I also wish the photo itself was larger. Closer to the 640 maximum pixels allowed.</td>', 'I truly hope you don''t have a phobia of love - that would be sad. A good concept, but the coloring is a bit odd. I also wish the photo itself was larger. Closer to the 640 maximum pixels allowed.', '2005-12-27 09:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980785, 271304, 41675, '<td valign="top">For me, I wish the bottles were more in focus, and I find the plug and wire in the background distracting.</td>', 'For me, I wish the bottles were more in focus, and I find the plug and wire in the background distracting.', '2005-12-27 09:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980786, 270446, 40912, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...</td>', 'Nicely done...', '2005-12-27 09:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980787, 270367, 41675, '<td valign="top">One point deducted for not having the actual phobia in your title as asked in the challenge. I like the use of black and white though.</td>', 'One point deducted for not having the actual phobia in your title as asked in the challenge. I like the use of black and white though.', '2005-12-27 09:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980788, 270918, 40912, '<td valign="top">While I don''t "see" fear in the shot, the title makes it... and can I say: Holy cow!! :)</td>', 'While I don''t "see" fear in the shot, the title makes it... and can I say: Holy cow!! :)', '2005-12-27 09:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980789, 271193, 41675, '<td valign="top">Awww, poor little thing. That medicine looks alot like milk. :-)</td>', 'Awww, poor little thing. That medicine looks alot like milk. :-)', '2005-12-27 09:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980791, 270094, 40912, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but the "fear" is escaping me..</td>', 'Lovely shot, but the "fear" is escaping me..', '2005-12-27 09:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980794, 270421, 41675, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a bit more contrast and I deducted a point for lack of phobia name in your title.</td>', 'I would have liked a bit more contrast and I deducted a point for lack of phobia name in your title.', '2005-12-27 09:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980795, 271098, 40912, '<td valign="top">Huh?</td>', 'Huh?', '2005-12-27 09:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980796, 270556, 41675, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, seems more like a pun than a phobia. Was this accidentally put into the wrong challenge?</td>', 'Hmmm, seems more like a pun than a phobia. Was this accidentally put into the wrong challenge?', '2005-12-27 09:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980798, 269756, 40912, '<td valign="top">Where''s the fear part? I think I''m missing it...</td>', 'Where''s the fear part? I think I''m missing it...', '2005-12-27 09:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980799, 269326, 41675, '<td valign="top">That is one nasty looking fish alright. Bit overboard on the black areas for my tastes and maybe if it was a bit more in focus.</td>', 'That is one nasty looking fish alright. Bit overboard on the black areas for my tastes and maybe if it was a bit more in focus.', '2005-12-27 09:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980800, 269727, 40912, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.. it seems to capture her fear. Well done. :)</td>', 'This is a great shot.. it seems to capture her fear. Well done. :)', '2005-12-27 09:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980802, 269456, 41675, '<td valign="top">Interesting phobia. Took my eyes a moment to find the duck. The background is distracing (items on the floor, the plant, etc.)</td>', 'Interesting phobia. Took my eyes a moment to find the duck. The background is distracing (items on the floor, the plant, etc.)', '2005-12-27 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980803, 270501, 40912, '<td valign="top">What a perfect expression!</td>', 'What a perfect expression!', '2005-12-27 09:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980806, 270473, 40912, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.. though it seems more like it''d be a fear of snow or big trees...</td>', 'I love this shot.. though it seems more like it''d be a fear of snow or big trees...', '2005-12-27 09:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980807, 271031, 41675, '<td valign="top">My first reaction was that he has a fear of being hit, the way he is cowering and covering his head. Makes me think of an old, faded 1960''s type snapshot.</td>', 'My first reaction was that he has a fear of being hit, the way he is cowering and covering his head. Makes me think of an old, faded 1960''s type snapshot.', '2005-12-27 09:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980808, 271113, 40912, '<td valign="top">Heh.. or fear of hairy knuckles?</td>', 'Heh.. or fear of hairy knuckles?', '2005-12-27 09:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980809, 271368, 41675, '<td valign="top">A point for making me chuckle.</td>', 'A point for making me chuckle.', '2005-12-27 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980813, 271012, 41675, '<td valign="top">I like the left hand side of your photo, but unfortunately my eyes keep getting drawn away from there and to the overly bright alley lights.</td>', 'I like the left hand side of your photo, but unfortunately my eyes keep getting drawn away from there and to the overly bright alley lights.', '2005-12-27 09:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980814, 270915, 41675, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the photo looks faded and grainy. Had this been a bit more in focus or more contrast, I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Good idea, but the photo looks faded and grainy. Had this been a bit more in focus or more contrast, I would have scored it higher.', '2005-12-27 09:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980815, 270992, 40912, '<td valign="top">What''s the phobia?</td>', 'What''s the phobia?', '2005-12-27 09:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980816, 270992, 41675, '<td valign="top">I deducted a point for not having an actual phobia name in your title as suggested in the challenge rules. I do like the off-centered composition and lighting though.</td>', 'I deducted a point for not having an actual phobia name in your title as suggested in the challenge rules. I do like the off-centered composition and lighting though.', '2005-12-27 09:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980819, 271248, 40912, '<td valign="top">Finally.. a shot that actually captures fear. Excellent.. a little grainy for my taste, but I think that''s more the wall than anything. Very well done! :)</td>', 'Finally.. a shot that actually captures fear. Excellent.. a little grainy for my taste, but I think that''s more the wall than anything. Very well done! :)', '2005-12-27 09:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980820, 269427, 41675, '<td valign="top">One point deducted for not having phobia name in title as suggested in challenge rules. I wonder how this would look rotated slightly counter-clockwise so that the pole in the middle was straight up and down - not slanted.</td>', 'One point deducted for not having phobia name in title as suggested in challenge rules. I wonder how this would look rotated slightly counter-clockwise so that the pole in the middle was straight up and down - not slanted.', '2005-12-27 09:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980822, 271350, 41675, '<td valign="top">Aww, poor Snoop. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Aww, poor Snoop. I like the lighting.', '2005-12-27 09:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980826, 271223, 41675, '<td valign="top">The treatment of your photo gives me the first impression that she is a battered woman. Bumping up a point after second go round.</td>', 'The treatment of your photo gives me the first impression that she is a battered woman. Bumping up a point after second go round.', '2005-12-27 09:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980827, 271092, 40912, '<td valign="top">How you managed to capture fear in these dolls really surprised me. Great job. :) I wouldn''t be surprised to see this get a ribbon.</td>', 'How you managed to capture fear in these dolls really surprised me. Great job. :) I wouldn''t be surprised to see this get a ribbon.', '2005-12-27 09:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1980828, 270591, 41675, '<td valign="top">If your photo had been larger, I think it would have greater impact and make it easier on the voters. Keep in mind we are allowed a maximum of 640 pixels.</td>', 'If your photo had been larger, I think it would have greater impact and make it easier on the voters. Keep in mind we are allowed a maximum of 640 pixels.', '2005-12-27 09:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
