(1982480, 270252, 25232, '<td valign="top">I really don''t see how this could be one photograph. Sure would be interested in how you did this.</td>', 'I really don''t see how this could be one photograph. Sure would be interested in how you did this.', '2005-12-28 04:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982534, 270974, 50199, '<td valign="top">A beautiful photo, but the *fear* element does not come across. I wonder if this photo was taken with this challenge in mind, or if this phobia was picked to correspond to the nice photo.</td>', 'A beautiful photo, but the *fear* element does not come across. I wonder if this photo was taken with this challenge in mind, or if this phobia was picked to correspond to the nice photo.', '2005-12-28 05:49:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982536, 270397, 4008, '<td valign="top">This is the only image so far that does not rely on the title to express the phobia. It shows the fear and the object of fear and conveys the message instantly. Well done. Only the mouse on the glass plate from underneath looks a bit unnatural, just on the floor might have been better, but I realise it would have been more difficult to get the composition right.</td>', 'This is the only image so far that does not rely on the title to express the phobia. It shows the fear and the object of fear and conveys the message instantly. Well done. Only the mouse on the glass plate from underneath looks a bit unnatural, just on the floor might have been better, but I realise it would have been more difficult to get the composition right.', '2005-12-28 05:50:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982538, 269800, 50199, '<td valign="top">the photo is set up nicely, but I don''t see the fear. The background shadow and grain is nice, though.</td>', 'the photo is set up nicely, but I don''t see the fear. The background shadow and grain is nice, though.', '2005-12-28 05:51:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982624, 270974, 48529, '<td valign="top">nice picture; the dark bottom corners adds a bit to the ''phobia'' feel.</td>', 'nice picture; the dark bottom corners adds a bit to the ''phobia'' feel.', '2005-12-28 07:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982630, 270953, 28299, '<td valign="top">Congrats - exellent shot and deserving especially because your wife is such a good sport. Ohmigosh, is she ever! She must love you very, very much to do that! LOL.</td>', 'Congrats - exellent shot and deserving especially because your wife is such a good sport. Ohmigosh, is she ever! She must love you very, very much to do that! LOL.', '2005-12-28 07:44:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982640, 269449, 28299, '<td valign="top">Definitely a phobia and a beautiful shot in b/w with all the birds fluttering about. Congrats on 5th. It was the only 10 I gave out.</td>', 'Definitely a phobia and a beautiful shot in b/w with all the birds fluttering about. Congrats on 5th. It was the only 10 I gave out.', '2005-12-28 07:58:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982641, 271076, 32767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Beautiful work. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2005-12-28 08:00:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982643, 271113, 28299, '<td valign="top">I actually thought those were human hands and my first thought was ewwwww. Good capture.</td>', 'I actually thought those were human hands and my first thought was ewwwww. Good capture.', '2005-12-28 08:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982645, 270877, 25270, '<td valign="top">Want to thank all those that voted and commented on this picture.  Understand the comments about saturation and sharpening.  After looking at the entry on different monitors while travelling this Christmas, noted the reduced saturation and sharpening.  It was, however a very overcast day.  Don''t understand the composition comments; I felt it was more important to capture the full impact of the catch rather than try to follow the 1/3 rule or some other rule.  I realize the submission was marginal for the phobia theme but couldn''t pass up the chance to get it viewed.  --I had originally named the shot "Ornithophobia--at least from the fish''s perspective".  I espeically enjoy nature photographs so will be posting some interesting shots after the new year.<br/> <br/>Thanks again...</td>', 'Want to thank all those that voted and commented on this picture.  Understand the comments about saturation and sharpening.  After looking at the entry on different monitors while travelling this Christmas, noted the reduced saturation and sharpening.  It was, however a very overcast day.  Don''t understand the composition comments; I felt it was more important to capture the full impact of the catch rather than try to follow the 1/3 rule or some other rule.  I realize the submission was marginal for the phobia theme but couldn''t pass up the chance to get it viewed.  --I had originally named the shot "Ornithophobia--at least from the fish''s perspective".  I espeically enjoy nature photographs so will be posting some interesting shots after the new year. Thanks again...', '2005-12-28 08:02:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982649, 271092, 10413, '<td valign="top">Was almost positive this was yours. Wonder why? :) Congratulations on another great finish Ken.</td>', 'Was almost positive this was yours. Wonder why? :) Congratulations on another great finish Ken.', '2005-12-28 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982653, 270953, 33845, '<td valign="top">wow this is so great :D<br/>Congratulations to the ribbon :D</td>', 'wow this is so great :DCongratulations to the ribbon :D', '2005-12-28 08:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982660, 270953, 32767, '<td valign="top">Really great image. Congats on your blue.</td>', 'Really great image. Congats on your blue.', '2005-12-28 08:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982663, 270217, 32767, '<td valign="top">Super cool image. Congrats on your ribbon.</td>', 'Super cool image. Congrats on your ribbon.', '2005-12-28 08:12:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982665, 270953, 20608, '<td valign="top">I used to have nightmares about being buried alive when I was younger and Ide wake up with the sheets wrapped around me. It is a truely terrifying thing to imagine. You have captured the feeling perfectly and this has been reflected in you winning the blue ribbon. CONGRATULATIONS.</td>', 'I used to have nightmares about being buried alive when I was younger and Ide wake up with the sheets wrapped around me. It is a truely terrifying thing to imagine. You have captured the feeling perfectly and this has been reflected in you winning the blue ribbon. CONGRATULATIONS.', '2005-12-28 08:13:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982667, 271076, 20608, '<td valign="top">HELLRAISER MAAAAAAAAAAAAAN... its that dude from Hellraiser ... what a freaky shot, CONGRATULATIONS</td>', 'HELLRAISER MAAAAAAAAAAAAAN... its that dude from Hellraiser ... what a freaky shot, CONGRATULATIONS', '2005-12-28 08:15:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982670, 270953, 45343, '<td valign="top">Well deserved blue!   I really cant find anything to improve.  Your negative space angled tilt of the mud adds to the energy of the shot.  I actually like the way that you have filled the frame and cut off a little of the hand and head  it adds to the sense of suffocation.</td>', 'Well deserved blue!   I really cant find anything to improve.  Your negative space angled tilt of the mud adds to the energy of the shot.  I actually like the way that you have filled the frame and cut off a little of the hand and head  it adds to the sense of suffocation.', '2005-12-28 08:18:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982676, 271076, 45343, '<td valign="top">Congratulations this is a wonderful shot.   I think the positioning and posing are perfect.   The interesting composition part to me is the fact that the all the nails provide leading lines strait to the subject as well as being part of the subject.  Only thing I might change is a tighter trim on some of the adhesives.   Well done  well deserved ribbon.</td>', 'Congratulations this is a wonderful shot.   I think the positioning and posing are perfect.   The interesting composition part to me is the fact that the all the nails provide leading lines strait to the subject as well as being part of the subject.  Only thing I might change is a tighter trim on some of the adhesives.   Well done  well deserved ribbon.', '2005-12-28 08:23:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(1982679, 270217, 45343, '<td valign="top">Will this be your new profile photo?   This is a wonderful (albeit, disturbed) image.   I think it is a perfect example of off center positioning of the subject.   Congratulations on your ribbon.</td>', 'Will this be your new profile photo?   This is a wonderful (albeit, disturbed) image.   I think it is a perfect example of off center positioning of the subject.   Congratulations on your ribbon.', '2005-12-28 08:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
