(2200817, 270974, 54481, '<td valign="top">I myself am a real limnophobic, in fact, I just had a panic attack in my room thinking about lakes. I right now have my feet up on my chair for fear that the floor will turn into a lake. I was searching for some info on the subject when I stumbled upon this picture. It may not seem scary to any of you, but when I see it, I feel a paralyzing fear. I could hardly scroll down I was so afraid.</td>', 'I myself am a real limnophobic, in fact, I just had a panic attack in my room thinking about lakes. I right now have my feet up on my chair for fear that the floor will turn into a lake. I was searching for some info on the subject when I stumbled upon this picture. It may not seem scary to any of you, but when I see it, I feel a paralyzing fear. I could hardly scroll down I was so afraid.', '2006-03-04 23:25:47.000000', NULL, 0),
